  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining the Project Scope**\n\nOkay, I\'m carefully dissecting this request. \"CNC Copilot\" with that tagline is the focus. I\'m noting the required roles: architect, CNC expert, and UI/UX engineer. It\'s a broad scope, so I need to establish the core responsibilities for each role to prevent mission creep. I will prioritize essential functions.\n\n\n**Outlining Milestones Rigorously**\n\nI\'ve established the foundation, and now I\'m breaking down the development into concrete, testable milestones as dictated. Each step demands a comprehensive preview, ensuring I adhere strictly to the \"no fakes\" directive. Currently, I\'m at Milestone 1: establishing project structure, design, navigation, Firebase auth, landing page, dashboard, and the /api/health endpoint.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Milestone Progress**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on Milestone 7. This involves integrating /api/tts functionality and defining crucial Firestore and Storage rules. Furthermore, I\'m working to implement error handling and empty state management, alongside ensuring responsiveness down to a 375px mobile viewport. I\'m focusing on starting from Milestone 1 for the app\'s structure and design. I will prepare for my Skill Check.\n\n\n"
