  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Blueprint & Rules**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `firebase-blueprint.json` file and the Firestore rules to understand the system\'s structure. I\'m focusing on the `users/{uid}` document, specifically extracting the required fields: `displayName`, `email`, `photoURL`, and the preference fields, `preferredLanguage` and `preferredController`, noting the language options and the possible controller choice. This will inform my next steps.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI\'ve been mapping out the data structures in detail now. Specifically, the schema for chats, messages, user activity, academy progress, usage, knowledge base documents, and feedback is being defined. It\'s a comprehensive view of how each element integrates into the system. I\'m focusing on attributes, roles, and how data is created and updated.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
