  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Server Integration**\n\nI\'m now putting together `server.ts`. The focus is connecting Express and Vite for development. I\'m mounting the `/api` routes and configuring the frontend to be served. I\'ve started the implementation, now I am considering how to include health checks.\n\n\n**Implementing Dev Mode**\n\nI\'ve got the development mode logic in `server.ts` now, using Vite\'s middleware. In production, it falls back to serving static files from the `dist` directory and handling the SPA routing. This includes the implementation of the static file serving and SPA routing as well. I\'m ensuring everything works together as expected.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1136305"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import express from \'express\';\\nimport path from \'path\';\\nimport { fileURLToPath } from \'url\';\\nimport { PORT } from \'./server/config.js\';\\nimport { healthRouter } from \'./server/routes/health.js\';\\nimport { userRouter } from \'./server/routes/user.js\';\\n\\nconst __filename = fileURLToPath(import.meta.url);\\nconst __dirname = path.dirname(__filename);\\n\\nasync function startServer() {\\n  const app = express();\\n  app.use(express.json({ limit: \'25mb\' }));\\n  app.use(express.urlencoded({ extended: true, limit: \'25mb\' }));\\n\\n  // Mount API endpoints\\n  app.use(\'/api\', healthRouter);\\n  app.use(\'/api/user\', userRouter);\\n\\n  const isDev = process.env.NODE_ENV !== \'production\';\\n\\n  if (isDev) {\\n    const { createServer } = await import(\'vite\');\\n    const vite = await createServer({\\n      server: { middlewareMode: true },\\n      appType: \'spa\',\\n    });\\n    app.use(vite.middlewares);\\n  } else {\\n    const distPath = path.resolve(__dirname, \'dist\');\\n    app.use(express.static(distPath));\\n    app.get(\'*\', (_req, res) => {\\n      res.sendFile(path.resolve(distPath, \'index.html\'));\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  app.listen(PORT, \'0.0.0.0\', () => {\\n    console.log(`[CNC Copilot] Unified full-stack server running on http://0.0.0.0:${PORT}`);\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nstartServer().catch(err => {\\n  console.error(\'[CNC Copilot] Server failed to start:\', err);\\n  process.exit(1);\\n});\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create root server.ts unifying Express backend and Vite frontend\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/server.ts\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating server.ts\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create server.ts\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 597525338
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
