  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining CSS Fundamentals**\n\nI\'m now laying the groundwork for the project\'s CSS, starting with a Tailwind import in `src/index.css`. I\'m including font families for a modern aesthetic, using Inter for sans-serif and JetBrains Mono for monospace text. Also, I\'ve added a subtle noise overlay inline SVG and am defining some helpful industrial-style styling helpers.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_990864"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@layer base {\\n  :root {\\n    --bg-base: #0B0F14;\\n    --color-primary: #FF7A1A;\\n    --color-secondary: #22D3EE;\\n    --color-success: #22C55E;\\n    --color-warning: #F59E0B;\\n    --color-danger: #EF4444;\\n    --color-text: #E6EDF3;\\n    --color-muted: #8B98A5;\\n    --color-border: #1F2A37;\\n  }\\n\\n  body {\\n    background-color: #0B0F14;\\n    color: #E6EDF3;\\n    font-family: \'Inter\', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, sans-serif;\\n    min-height: 100vh;\\n    position: relative;\\n    overflow-x: hidden;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* Inline SVG noise overlay (opacity 0.04) */\\n  body::before {\\n    content: \\\"\\\";\\n    position: fixed;\\n    top: 0;\\n    left: 0;\\n    width: 100%;\\n    height: 100%;\\n    pointer-events: none;\\n    z-index: 9999;\\n    opacity: 0.04;\\n    background-image: url(\\\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=\'0 0 200 200\' xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%3E%3Cfilter id=\'noiseFilter\'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=\'fractalNoise\' baseFrequency=\'0.8\' numOctaves=\'3\' stitchTiles=\'stitch\'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=\'100%25\' height=\'100%25\' filter=\'url(%23noiseFilter)\'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\\\");\\n  }\\n\\n  /* Mono font for all numbers, coordinates, G-code */\\n  .font-mono,\\n  code,\\n  pre,\\n  input[type=\\\"number\\\"],\\n  .tabular-nums {\\n    font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/* Glass Panels */\\n.glass-panel {\\n  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\\n  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\\n  border: 1px solid #1F2A37;\\n  border-radius: 12px;\\n  transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);\\n}\\n\\n.glass-panel:hover {\\n  border-color: rgba(255, 122, 26, 0.3);\\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(255, 122, 26, 0.05);\\n}\\n\\n/* 48x48 px minimum touch target for shopfloor handling */\\n.touch-target {\\n  min-width: 48px;\\n  min-height: 48px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Visible focus ring in #22D3EE */\\nbutton:focus-visible,\\na:focus-visible,\\ninput:focus-visible,\\nselect:focus-visible,\\ntextarea:focus-visible {\\n  outline: 2px solid #22D3EE;\\n  outline-offset: 2px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom dark scrollbar */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 6px;\\n  height: 6px;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: #0B0F14;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: #1F2A37;\\n  border-radius: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: #FF7A1A;\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Configure src/index.css with dark industrial design system, noise overlay, and typography\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating src/index.css\",\"toolSummary\":\"Configure industrial design system CSS\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
