  planner_response {
    response: "### Milestone 1 Complete: Project Foundation, Design System, Firebase Auth, Landing Page, Dashboard, and Full-Stack Server\n\n#### Files Created or Modified:\n- `metadata.json` \342\200\224 Set app name \"CNC Copilot\", description, and camera/microphone permissions.\n- `index.html` \342\200\224 Updated title, SEO metadata, dark theme class, and imported Inter & JetBrains Mono fonts.\n- `.env.example` \342\200\224 Added server environment variable keys (`GEMINI_API_KEY`, `FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID`, `STORAGE_BUCKET`, `ADMIN_EMAILS`, `APP_URL`).\n- `firebase-blueprint.json` \342\200\224 Intermediate schema definition for users, chats, messages, activity, academy progress, and knowledge base documents.\n- `firestore.rules` \342\200\224 Deployed security rules enforcing strict per-user RBAC, role protection, and public access restrictions.\n- `server.ts` \342\200\224 Full-stack Node.js + Express + TypeScript entry point serving `/api` and Vite middlewares on port 3000.\n- `server/config.ts` \342\200\224 Model aliases (`MODEL_FLASH`, `MODEL_PRO`, `MODEL_TTS`), Firebase project settings, admin emails, and API configurations.\n- `server/firebase.ts` \342\200\224 Server-side `firebase-admin` integration using application default credentials and project configuration.\n- `server/authMiddleware.ts` \342\200\224 Bearer ID token verification middleware attaching user profile, email, and admin roles.\n- `server/rateLimiter.ts` \342\200\224 Transactional daily limit enforcement (100 AI requests/day per user, admins exempt).\n- `server/logger.ts` \342\200\224 Single-line structured JSON logger recording `uidHash` (sha256 12 chars), latency, tokens, and model details without message text.\n- `server/geminiClient.ts` \342\200\224 Gemini client with 25-second timeout, 2-second retry backoff, and localized error messages.\n- `server/routes/health.ts` \342\200\224 Public health check endpoint returning status, app name, and Firebase project.\n- `server/routes/user.ts` \342\200\224 Protected endpoints for profile lookup, language/controller preference updates, and recent activity streams.\n- `src/index.css` \342\200\224 Dark industrial design system (#0B0F14 background, subtle noise SVG overlay, #FF7A1A safety orange, #22D3EE coolant cyan, 48px touch targets, JetBrains Mono numbers).\n- `src/lib/firebase.ts` \342\200\224 Client Firebase Auth (Google Sign-In), Firestore initialization, and standardized error handling.\n- `src/context/AuthContext.tsx` \342\200\224 Real-time authentication and user preference state management.\n- `src/components/Navigation.tsx` \342\200\224 Desktop top bar with spindle icon, navigation links, multilingual selector (EN, HI, ML, TA), avatar menu, and mobile 5-tab bar.\n- `src/components/Hero3DScene.tsx` \342\200\224 Interactive Three.js 3D scene with spinning end mill, aluminium stock block, and orange toolpath trajectory.\n- `src/components/LandingPage.tsx` \342\200\224 Signed-out landing page with hero, \"Fix today\'s machine\", \"Build tomorrow\'s operator\" Academy band, 4-step workflow, and Google Cloud tech stack.\n- `src/components/Dashboard.tsx` \342\200\224 Signed-in operator dashboard with time-based greetings, live date, shift calculation (Shift 1/2/3), 4 quick action cards, real-time activity stream, and grounded manuals list.\n- `src/App.tsx` \342\200\224 Main application router switching between Landing Page and Operator Dashboard based on auth state.\n\n---\n\n### 3-Step Manual Test for the Preview:\n\n1. **Verify Public Health & Landing Experience**:\n   - Open the preview URL. Confirm the dark industrial theme (#0B0F14) with subtle noise texture, the headline *\"Your machine stopped. Copilot knows why.\"*, and the auto-rotating 3D milling cutter scene on the right.\n   - Click **\"See how it works\"** to test smooth scrolling down to the 4-step deterministic workflow and the \"Built on Google\" tech stack.\n\n2. **Verify Google Sign-In & Dashboard Synchronization**:\n   - Click the orange **\"Sign in with Google\"** button in the top navigation or hero section.\n   - Upon sign-in, observe the transition to the **Operator Dashboard**. Verify the localized greeting (e.g., *\"Good morning / afternoon / evening\"*), current date, active shift window, and the 4 quick action cards (*Diagnose Alarm*, *Calculate Feeds*, *Verify G-code*, *Crash Lab*).\n   - Test the language dropdown in the header to switch between English, Hindi, Malayalam, and Tamil.\n\n3. **Verify Server Health & Middleware Security**:\n   - Open a browser tab or test `GET /api/health` to confirm the JSON response (`status: \"ok\"`, `app: \"CNC Copilot\"`, `firebaseProject: \"cnc-copilot-abc26\"`).\n   - Attempting an unauthorized request to `/api/user/me` without a Bearer token returns HTTP 401, confirming backend token verification is active.\n\nReady to proceed with **Milestone 2 (cutting engine + /calculator + /api/explain)** whenever you\'re ready!"
    thinking: "**Reviewing The Prompt**\n\nI\'ve got a clean build, which is great. Now I\'m taking a fresh look at the prompt\'s instructions. Specifically, I need to focus on the structure for milestones. It looks like it wants a structure, a design, auth, and navigation in milestone one. Looks like it wants files and a test at each stop along the way.\n\n\n"
