  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing CSS Styles**\n\nI\'m currently examining `src/index.css` to identify theme variables and utility classes. I plan to configure the Tailwind theme using `@theme`, beginning with the surface color. This approach should simplify future theme modifications.\n\n\n**Extracting Color Variables**\n\nI\'ve extracted the color variables from the CSS file. Now I have a clear mapping of the defined color values, including surface, on-surface, primary, secondary, and tertiary colors with their respective variants. My next step involves defining a Tailwind theme using these extracted variables.\n\n\n**Defining Additional Variables**\n\nI\'ve gathered more variables now, including error colors, background colors, and font styles. I\'m focusing on organizing these variables effectively. I\'m also capturing spacing values to ensure consistent layouts. My current plan is to integrate these into the Tailwind configuration.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1437676"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"@import \\\"tailwindcss\\\";\\n\\n@theme {\\n  --color-surface: #101419;\\n  --color-surface-dim: #101419;\\n  --color-surface-bright: #36393f;\\n  --color-surface-container-lowest: #0a0e13;\\n  --color-surface-container-low: #181c21;\\n  --color-surface-container: #1c2025;\\n  --color-surface-container-high: #262a30;\\n  --color-surface-container-highest: #31353b;\\n  --color-on-surface: #e0e2ea;\\n  --color-on-surface-variant: #e0c0b1;\\n  --color-inverse-surface: #e0e2ea;\\n  --color-inverse-on-surface: #2d3136;\\n  --color-outline: #a78b7d;\\n  --color-outline-variant: #584236;\\n  --color-primary: #ffb68e;\\n  --color-on-primary: #542200;\\n  --color-primary-container: #ff7a1a;\\n  --color-on-primary-container: #5e2700;\\n  --color-inverse-primary: #9c4500;\\n  --color-secondary: #5de6ff;\\n  --color-on-secondary: #00363e;\\n  --color-secondary-container: #00cbe6;\\n  --color-on-secondary-container: #00515d;\\n  --color-secondary-fixed: #a2eeff;\\n  --color-secondary-fixed-dim: #2fd9f4;\\n  --color-tertiary: #bcc7d8;\\n  --color-on-tertiary: #26313f;\\n  --color-tertiary-container: #96a1b1;\\n  --color-on-tertiary-container: #2d3845;\\n  --color-tertiary-fixed: #d8e3f5;\\n  --color-tertiary-fixed-dim: #bcc7d8;\\n  --color-error: #ffb4ab;\\n  --color-on-error: #690005;\\n  --color-error-container: #93000a;\\n  --color-on-error-container: #ffdad6;\\n  --color-background: #101419;\\n  --color-on-background: #e0e2ea;\\n\\n  --spacing-space-xs: 0.25rem;\\n  --spacing-space-sm: 0.5rem;\\n  --spacing-space-md: 1rem;\\n  --spacing-space-lg: 1.5rem;\\n  --spacing-space-xl: 2rem;\\n  --spacing-margin: 1.5rem;\\n  --spacing-gutter: 1rem;\\n}\\n\\n@layer base {\\n  body {\\n    background-color: #0a0e13;\\n    color: #e0e2ea;\\n    font-family: \'Inter\', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, sans-serif;\\n    min-height: 100vh;\\n    position: relative;\\n    overflow-x: hidden;\\n  }\\n\\n  /* Inline SVG noise overlay (opacity 0.04) */\\n  body::before {\\n    content: \\\"\\\";\\n    position: fixed;\\n    top: 0;\\n    left: 0;\\n    width: 100%;\\n    height: 100%;\\n    pointer-events: none;\\n    z-index: 9999;\\n    opacity: 0.04;\\n    background-image: url(\\\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=\'0 0 200 200\' xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\'%3E%3Cfilter id=\'noiseFilter\'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=\'fractalNoise\' baseFrequency=\'0.8\' numOctaves=\'3\' stitchTiles=\'stitch\'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=\'100%25\' height=\'100%25\' filter=\'url(%23noiseFilter)\'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\\\");\\n  }\\n\\n  /* Mono font for all numbers, coordinates, G-code */\\n  .font-mono,\\n  code,\\n  pre,\\n  input[type=\\\"number\\\"],\\n  .tabular-nums {\\n    font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace;\\n  }\\n}\\n\\n/* Material Symbols Outlined Icon Helper */\\n.material-symbols-outlined {\\n  font-family: \'Material Symbols Outlined\';\\n  font-weight: normal;\\n  font-style: normal;\\n  font-size: 24px;\\n  line-height: 1;\\n  letter-spacing: normal;\\n  text-transform: none;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n  white-space: nowrap;\\n  word-wrap: normal;\\n  direction: ltr;\\n  -webkit-font-feature-settings: \'liga\';\\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\\n  vertical-align: middle;\\n}\\n\\n/* Typography tokens matching DESIGN.md */\\n.font-headline-xl { font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif; font-size: 32px; line-height: 40px; font-weight: 700; }\\n.font-headline-lg { font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; line-height: 32px; font-weight: 600; }\\n.font-headline-md { font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: 600; }\\n.font-headline-sm { font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 600; }\\n.font-body-lg { font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 400; }\\n.font-body-md { font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 400; }\\n.font-body-sm { font-family: \'Inter\', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 400; }\\n.font-code-lg { font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace; font-size: 20px; line-height: 28px; font-weight: 600; }\\n.font-code-md { font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px; font-weight: 500; }\\n.font-code-sm { font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 400; }\\n.font-label-md { font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: 500; }\\n.font-label-sm { font-family: \'JetBrains Mono\', monospace; font-size: 10px; line-height: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\\n\\n/* 48x48 px minimum touch target for shopfloor handling */\\n.touch-target {\\n  min-width: 48px;\\n  min-height: 48px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Visible focus ring in #22D3EE */\\nbutton:focus-visible,\\na:focus-visible,\\ninput:focus-visible,\\nselect:focus-visible,\\ntextarea:focus-visible {\\n  outline: 2px solid #5de6ff;\\n  outline-offset: 2px;\\n}\\n\\n/* Custom dark scrollbar */\\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\\n  width: 6px;\\n  height: 6px;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\\n  background: #0a0e13;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\\n  background: #1f2a37;\\n  border-radius: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\\n  background: #ff7a1a;\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Update src/index.css with M3 tokens, typography classes, and Material Symbols styles\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/index.css\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating src/index.css\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update CSS with M3 color tokens and typography\"}"
