  planner_response {
    response: "### Operator Dashboard Redesign Complete\n\nThe signed-in Operator Dashboard has been refactored to align with `operator_dashboard/code.html` and `DESIGN.md`. All visual components now use Material Symbols Outlined, the M3 dark industrial palette, 12px panel curves, 8px controls, 4px square badges, and JetBrains Mono for all numeric readouts.\n\n---\n\n### Data Mapping Summary:\n1. **Conditional Alert Banner**: Displays **only** when the user has an active chat activity within the last 24 hours that contains an alarm code (e.g. `SV0401`), reading: `\"Last diagnosis: {alarm} on {controller}. {title}\"` with a `\"Continue\"` button that navigates directly to that diagnostic chat. It remains hidden when no active alarm exists.\n2. **Greeting Block**: Dynamic greeting (`Good morning/afternoon/evening, {firstName}`), live formatted date, computed shift window (`Shift 1 06:00-14:00`, `Shift 2 14:00-22:00`, `Shift 3 22:00-06:00`), and the operator\'s active controller profile (`Fanuc 0i-MF`, `Mitsubishi M80`, or `Generic ISO`).\n3. **The 4 Real Stat Chips**:\n   - `Questions today`: Real count of `chat` activities logged today.\n   - `Calculations today`: Real count of `calc` activities logged today.\n   - `Programs verified`: Real count of `gcode` audits logged today.\n   - `Crash Lab (+150 XP)`: Real operator XP and level (e.g. *Level 2 Setter* / *Trainee*) linking to the Academy.\n4. **Quick Action Cards Grid**:\n   - `Diagnose Alarm`: Orange `#FF7A1A` top border, `photo_camera` icon, opens Agent with camera.\n   - `Calculate Feeds`: Cyan `#5DE6FF` top border, `calculate` icon, opens Cutting Calculator.\n   - `Verify G-Code`: Cyan-fixed `#A2EEFF` top border, `terminal` icon, opens G-code Verifier.\n   - `Academy \342\200\242 Crash Lab`: Cyan `#5DE6FF` top border, `school` icon, opens Crash Lab.\n   - `Knowledge Base`: Tertiary `#D8E3F5` top border, `menu_book` icon with `ADMIN` tag (visible only to administrators).\n5. **Copilot Activity (Last 7 Days)**:\n   - Dynamic SVG area chart in the Stitch cyan curve style (`#5DE6FF` gradient fill with orange overload cap) graphing real daily activity volumes over the past 7 calendar days.\n   - 4 metric readouts below: *Total Chats*, *Calculations*, *Programs Verified*, and *Crashes Avoided* (missions passed in Academy). Shows real zero states without fake values.\n6. **Last Screen Snapshot**:\n   - Displays the most recent captured pendant screenshot from diagnostic conversations.\n   - Features a styled empty state when no snapshots exist yet: *\"Snap a controller screen in the Agent to diagnose it.\"* with an **\"Open Agent Camera\"** quick action.\n7. **Recent Activity & Shop Logs**:\n   - Interactive category tabs (`All`, `Calculations`, `Alarms`, `Simulations`) filtering real records from `users/{uid}/activity`.\n   - Action buttons (*Resume*, *View Diagnosis*, *Open Verifier*) linking to the respective session.\n8. **Pinned Manuals & Shop Standards**:\n   - Displays cards for all documents indexed with status `Ready` from `kb_docs`.\n   - `+ Pin Manual` CTA is shown exclusively to workshop administrators and directs to `/kb`.\n9. **Top Navigation & Industrial Footer**:\n   - Precision header matching the design template with spindle icon, `v2.4 Core` badge, controller switcher (`Fanuc 0i-MF` / `Mitsubishi M80` / `Generic ISO`), language dropdown (EN, HI, ML, TA), notification bell, and user avatar.\n   - Industrial telemetry footer stating `\"CNC COPILOT INDUSTRIAL TELEMETRY | STATION ID: MC-094\"` and `\"BUILT FOR GOOGLE CLOUD AI BUILDER CUP 2026\"`.\n\n---\n\n### Files Changed:\n- `index.html` \342\200\224 Linked Google Fonts `Material Symbols Outlined` stylesheet.\n- `src/index.css` \342\200\224 Added `@theme` definitions with M3 tokens (`surface-container-lowest`, `surface-container`, `primary-container`, `secondary`, etc.), typography scale, and Material Symbols utility rules.\n- `src/components/Navigation.tsx` \342\200\224 Replaced Lucide icons with Material Symbols Outlined, added the controller selector dropdown, and matched the template header layout.\n- `src/components/Dashboard.tsx` \342\200\224 Complete overhaul of the signed-in dashboard matching `operator_dashboard/code.html` layout, cards, SVG activity chart, snapshot viewer, and Firestore data bindings.\n- `src/components/LandingPage.tsx` \342\200\224 Replaced Lucide icons with Material Symbols Outlined and updated button tokens.\n- `src/App.tsx` \342\200\224 Replaced Lucide icons with Material Symbols Outlined across the application routing shells."
    modified_response: "### Operator Dashboard Redesign Complete\n\nThe signed-in Operator Dashboard has been refactored to align with `operator_dashboard/code.html` and `DESIGN.md`. All visual components now use Material Symbols Outlined, the M3 dark industrial palette, 12px panel curves, 8px controls, 4px square badges, and JetBrains Mono for all numeric readouts.\n\n---\n\n### Data Mapping Summary:\n1. **Conditional Alert Banner**: Displays **only** when the user has an active chat activity within the last 24 hours that contains an alarm code (e.g. `SV0401`), reading: `\"Last diagnosis: {alarm} on {controller}. {title}\"` with a `\"Continue\"` button that navigates directly to that diagnostic chat. It remains hidden when no active alarm exists.\n2. **Greeting Block**: Dynamic greeting (`Good morning/afternoon/evening, {firstName}`), live formatted date, computed shift window (`Shift 1 06:00-14:00`, `Shift 2 14:00-22:00`, `Shift 3 22:00-06:00`), and the operator\'s active controller profile (`Fanuc 0i-MF`, `Mitsubishi M80`, or `Generic ISO`).\n3. **The 4 Real Stat Chips**:\n   - `Questions today`: Real count of `chat` activities logged today.\n   - `Calculations today`: Real count of `calc` activities logged today.\n   - `Programs verified`: Real count of `gcode` audits logged today.\n   - `Crash Lab (+150 XP)`: Real operator XP and level (e.g. *Level 2 Setter* / *Trainee*) linking to the Academy.\n4. **Quick Action Cards Grid**:\n   - `Diagnose Alarm`: Orange `#FF7A1A` top border, `photo_camera` icon, opens Agent with camera.\n   - `Calculate Feeds`: Cyan `#5DE6FF` top border, `calculate` icon, opens Cutting Calculator.\n   - `Verify G-Code`: Cyan-fixed `#A2EEFF` top border, `terminal` icon, opens G-code Verifier.\n   - `Academy \342\200\242 Crash Lab`: Cyan `#5DE6FF` top border, `school` icon, opens Crash Lab.\n   - `Knowledge Base`: Tertiary `#D8E3F5` top border, `menu_book` icon with `ADMIN` tag (visible only to administrators).\n5. **Copilot Activity (Last 7 Days)**:\n   - Dynamic SVG area chart in the Stitch cyan curve style (`#5DE6FF` gradient fill with orange overload cap) graphing real daily activity volumes over the past 7 calendar days.\n   - 4 metric readouts below: *Total Chats*, *Calculations*, *Programs Verified*, and *Crashes Avoided* (missions passed in Academy). Shows real zero states without fake values.\n6. **Last Screen Snapshot**:\n   - Displays the most recent captured pendant screenshot from diagnostic conversations.\n   - Features a styled empty state when no snapshots exist yet: *\"Snap a controller screen in the Agent to diagnose it.\"* with an **\"Open Agent Camera\"** quick action.\n7. **Recent Activity & Shop Logs**:\n   - Interactive category tabs (`All`, `Calculations`, `Alarms`, `Simulations`) filtering real records from `users/{uid}/activity`.\n   - Action buttons (*Resume*, *View Diagnosis*, *Open Verifier*) linking to the respective session.\n8. **Pinned Manuals & Shop Standards**:\n   - Displays cards for all documents indexed with status `Ready` from `kb_docs`.\n   - `+ Pin Manual` CTA is shown exclusively to workshop administrators and directs to `/kb`.\n9. **Top Navigation & Industrial Footer**:\n   - Precision header matching the design template with spindle icon, `v2.4 Core` badge, controller switcher (`Fanuc 0i-MF` / `Mitsubishi M80` / `Generic ISO`), language dropdown (EN, HI, ML, TA), notification bell, and user avatar.\n   - Industrial telemetry footer stating `\"CNC COPILOT INDUSTRIAL TELEMETRY | STATION ID: MC-094\"` and `\"BUILT FOR GOOGLE CLOUD AI BUILDER CUP 2026\"`.\n\n---\n\n### Files Changed:\n- `index.html` \342\200\224 Linked Google Fonts `Material Symbols Outlined` stylesheet.\n- `src/index.css` \342\200\224 Added `@theme` definitions with M3 tokens (`surface-container-lowest`, `surface-container`, `primary-container`, `secondary`, etc.), typography scale, and Material Symbols utility rules.\n- `src/components/Navigation.tsx` \342\200\224 Replaced Lucide icons with Material Symbols Outlined, added the controller selector dropdown, and matched the template header layout.\n- `src/components/Dashboard.tsx` \342\200\224 Complete overhaul of the signed-in dashboard matching `operator_dashboard/code.html` layout, cards, SVG activity chart, snapshot viewer, and Firestore data bindings.\n- `src/components/LandingPage.tsx` \342\200\224 Replaced Lucide icons with Material Symbols Outlined and updated button tokens.\n- `src/App.tsx` \342\200\224 Replaced Lucide icons with Material Symbols Outlined across the application routing shells."
