server\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Restart dev server after dashboard update\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":167,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:13:01Z\",\"input_tokens\":2257,\"cache_read_tokens\":289882,\"output_tokens\":90,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"curl -s http://localhost:3000/api/health\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"5000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking server health\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Verify server health after update\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":169,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:13:07Z\",\"input_tokens\":2363,\"cache_read_tokens\":290012,\"output_tokens\":1182,\"content\":\"### Operator Dashboard Redesign Complete\\n\\nThe signed-in Operator Dashboard has been refactored to align with `operator_dashboard/code.html` and `DESIGN.md`. All visual components now use Material Symbols Outlined, the M3 dark industrial palette, 12px panel curves, 8px controls, 4px square badges, and JetBrains Mono for all numeric readouts.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Data Mapping Summary:\\n1. **Conditional Alert Banner**: Displays **only** when the user has an active chat activity within the last 24 hours that contains an al\\n<truncated 3399 bytes>\\ndded the controller selector dropdown, and matched the template header layout.\\n- `src/components/Dashboard.tsx` \342\200\224 Complete overhaul of the signed-in dashboard matching `operator_dashboard/code.html` layout, cards, SVG activity chart, snapshot viewer, and Firestore data bindings.\\n- `src/components/LandingPage.tsx` \342\200\224 Replaced Lucide icons with Material Symbols Outlined and updated button tokens.\\n- `src/App.tsx` \342\200\224 Replaced Lucide icons with Material Symbols Outlined across the application routing shells.\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":170,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"