  planner_response {
    response: "The Operator Dashboard and cutting physics architecture have been updated to match the design specifications, tokens, and data integrity requirements:\n\n### Key Implementations\n\n- **Strict M3 & Industrial Design System**: Configured Tailwind tokens (`surface-container-lowest #0a0e13`, `surface-container #1c2025`, `primary-container #FF7A1A`, `secondary #5DE6FF`), 12px card radiuses, 8px interactive controls, 4px badges, Material Symbols Outlined icon system, and JetBrains Mono for all numbers and labels.\n- **Alert Banner**: Evaluates the user\'s latest 24h chat activity for alarm codes (e.g., `SV0401`, `ALARM 1024`). Renders with an active alert banner and direct \"Continue\" button, or remains hidden when no alarm is active.\n- **Greeting & Live Cell Header**: Computes operational shifts in real time (`Shift 1 06:00\342\200\22314:00`, `Shift 2 14:00\342\200\22322:00`, `Shift 3 22:00\342\200\22306:00`) alongside the user\'s preferred controller cell.\n- **Live Stat Deck**: Live counters for *Questions today*, *Calculations today*, *Programs verified today* queried from `users/{uid}/activity`, plus real Crash Lab XP and Level chips.\n- **Quick Action Cards**: 5 industrial cards with distinctive colored top borders (Diagnose Alarm, Calculate Feeds, Verify G-Code, Crash Lab, and Admin Knowledge Base).\n- **Copilot 7-Day Activity & Readouts**: Real SVG area chart tracking daily operations across chats, calculations, and verified programs, with four real numerical readouts.\n- **Screen Snapshot Panel**: Renders the most recent pendant capture from agent messages with caption and diagnosis link, or displays a designed empty state.\n- **Shop Logs & Filter Tabs**: Activity rows filterable by *All*, *Calculations*, *Alarms*, and *Simulations* with direct action triggers.\n- **Pinned Manuals Grid**: Live query of `kb_docs` with `status: Ready`; the `+ Pin Manual` control is restricted to workshop administrators.\n- **Firebase Security & Error Handling**: Updated `firestore.rules` to permit authenticated owners to record their cutting calculations and academy progress; handled `auth/popup-closed-by-user` gracefully during Google sign-in."
    thinking: "**Reviewing Current Instructions**\n\nI\'ve just finished thoroughly reviewing the user\'s instructions, specifically focusing on the attached Stitch HTML and the DESIGN.md file. My next step is to begin mapping the layout, components, and classes in the HTML to the specifications in the design document.\n\n\n**Mapping Data Requirements**\n\nI\'m now focusing on replacing all hardcoded elements with real or designed empty states. I\'m ensuring no sensitive information like machine statuses or operator names are displayed unless they\'re actually available in the app. My main update is synchronizing the Operator Dashboard with the M3 color tokens, and that the layout is now using 12px cards, 8px controls, and 4px badges. The dashboard now contains real data through several components.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "The Operator Dashboard and cutting physics architecture have been updated to match the design specifications, tokens, and data integrity requirements:\n\n### Key Implementations\n\n- **Strict M3 & Industrial Design System**: Configured Tailwind tokens (`surface-container-lowest #0a0e13`, `surface-container #1c2025`, `primary-container #FF7A1A`, `secondary #5DE6FF`), 12px card radiuses, 8px interactive controls, 4px badges, Material Symbols Outlined icon system, and JetBrains Mono for all numbers and labels.\n- **Alert Banner**: Evaluates the user\'s latest 24h chat activity for alarm codes (e.g., `SV0401`, `ALARM 1024`). Renders with an active alert banner and direct \"Continue\" button, or remains hidden when no alarm is active.\n- **Greeting & Live Cell Header**: Computes operational shifts in real time (`Shift 1 06:00\342\200\22314:00`, `Shift 2 14:00\342\200\22322:00`, `Shift 3 22:00\342\200\22306:00`) alongside the user\'s preferred controller cell.\n- **Live Stat Deck**: Live counters for *Questions today*, *Calculations today*, *Programs verified today* queried from `users/{uid}/activity`, plus real Crash Lab XP and Level chips.\n- **Quick Action Cards**: 5 industrial cards with distinctive colored top borders (Diagnose Alarm, Calculate Feeds, Verify G-Code, Crash Lab, and Admin Knowledge Base).\n- **Copilot 7-Day Activity & Readouts**: Real SVG area chart tracking daily operations across chats, calculations, and verified programs, with four real numerical readouts.\n- **Screen Snapshot Panel**: Renders the most recent pendant capture from agent messages with caption and diagnosis link, or displays a designed empty state.\n- **Shop Logs & Filter Tabs**: Activity rows filterable by *All*, *Calculations*, *Alarms*, and *Simulations* with direct action triggers.\n- **Pinned Manuals Grid**: Live query of `kb_docs` with `status: Ready`; the `+ Pin Manual` control is restricted to workshop administrators.\n- **Firebase Security & Error Handling**: Updated `firestore.rules` to permit authenticated owners to record their cutting calculations and academy progress; handled `auth/popup-closed-by-user` gracefully during Google sign-in."
