:\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:29:49Z\",\"input_tokens\":2805,\"cache_read_tokens\":124079,\"output_tokens\":507,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update Calculate button with logCalculation call and active state feedback\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"671\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Wire logCalculation and feedback state to Calculate button\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"            {/* Recalculate Physics CTA Button */}\\\\n            <button\\\\n              onClick={logCalculation}\\\\n              className={`w-full min-h-[48px] py-space-sm rounded-lg font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-cen\\n<truncated 662 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"660\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"            {/* Recalculate Physics CTA Button */}\\\\n            <button\\\\n              onClick={() => {\\\\n                // Flash recalculation\\\\n              }}\\\\n              className=\\\\\\\"w-full min-h-[48px] py-space-sm rounded-lg bg-primary-container ho\\n<truncated 440 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/calculator/CuttingCalculator.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating button in CuttingCalculator\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update Calculate button in CuttingCalculator\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":307,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:30:02Z\",\"input_tokens\":3210,\"cache_read_tokens\":124768,\"output_tokens\":52,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Linting codebase\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Verify typescript after edit\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":309,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:30:49Z\",\"input_tokens\":2252,\"cache_read_tokens\":125879,\"output_tokens\":42,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Verify applet build\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":311,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:31:00Z\",\"input_tokens\":2223,\"cache_read_tokens\":126032,\"output_tokens\":91,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"git status -s\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"2000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking git status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check changed files\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":313,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:31:04Z\",\"input_tokens\":2295,\"cache_read_tokens\":126155,\"output_tokens\":89,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598/task-312\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking git status task\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check status task\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":316,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:31:07Z\",\"input_tokens\":2510,\"cache_read_tokens\":126347,\"output_tokens\":1086,\"content\":\"The Operator Dashboard and cutting physics architecture have been updated to match the design specifications, tokens, and data integrity requirements:\\n\\n### Key Implementations\\n\\n- **Strict M3 & Industrial Design System**: Configured Tailwind tokens (`surface-container-lowest #0a0e13`, `surface-container #1c2025`, `primary-container #FF7A1A`, `secondary #5DE6FF`), 12px card radiuses, 8px interactive controls, 4px badges, Material Symbols Outlined icon system, and JetBrains Mono for all numbers and labels.\\n- *\\n<truncated 1100 bytes>\\nte.\\n- **Shop Logs & Filter Tabs**: Activity rows filterable by *All*, *Calculations*, *Alarms*, and *Simulations* with direct action triggers.\\n- **Pinned Manuals Grid**: Live query of `kb_docs` with `status: Ready`; the `+ Pin Manual` control is restricted to workshop administrators.\\n- **Firebase Security & Error Handling**: Updated `firestore.rules` to permit authenticated owners to record their cutting calculations and academy progress; handled `auth/popup-closed-by-user` gracefully during Google sign-in.\",\"thinking\":\"**Reviewing Current Instructions**\\n\\nI\'ve just finished thoroughly reviewing the user\'s instructions, specifically focusing on the attached Stitch HTML and the DESIGN.md file. My next step is to begin mapping the layout, components, and classes in the HTML to the specifications in the design document.\\n\\n\\n**Mapping Data Requirements**\\n\\nI\'m now focusing on replacing all hardcoded elements with real or designed empty states. I\'m ensuring no sensitive information like machine statuses or operator names are displayed unless they\'re actually available in the app. My main update is synchronizing the Operator Dashboard with the M3 color tokens, and that the layout is now using 12px cards, 8px controls, and 4px badges. The dashboard now contains real data through several components.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":317,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:37:27Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nFix the errors in the app\\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\\nfix_it_trigger: manual\\nerror 0: [CuttingCalculator] Explain error: Error: CNC Copilot is temporarily experiencing high load. Please retry in a moment.\\n    at handleAskCopilot (https://ais-dev-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app/src/components/calculator/CuttingCalculator.tsx:127:11)\\nerror 1: [Gemini] Call failure: {\\\"error\\\":{\\\"code\\\":404,\\\"message\\\":\\\"This model models/gemini-2.5-flash is no longer available to new users. Ple\\n<truncated 437 bytes>\\ns: 2026-10-16T01:37:27-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nUser Email: biju0716@gmail.com\\nThe user\'s firestore db is ai-studio-cnccopilot-3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598 and you must always load the firebase skill when processing queries that require interacting with the database or Firebase services.\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":318,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:37:27Z\",\"input_tokens\":130622,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":475,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Error**\\n\\nOkay, I\'m now zeroing in on the precise error message the system returned. I\'m focusing on \\\"CNC Copilot is temporarily experiencing high load. Please retry in a moment.\\\" The error\'s source and the user\'s potential actions are key considerations moving forward. I\'m examining the implication of \\\"high load\\\" and if there\'s a workaround.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/skills/system_skills/gemini_api/SKILL.md\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Reading gemini_api skill\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read gemini_api skill for model selection\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":320,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:37:35Z\",\"input_tokens\":18920,\"cache_read_tokens\":130391,\"output_tokens\":447,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Error**\\n\\nI\'m focusing on the error message, noting it specifies a deprecated model, `gemini-2.5-flash`. The crucial part is the code recommends the newer model, `gemini-3.8-flash`. I need to ensure the code references that instead.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/server/geminiClient.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing geminiClient.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check gemini client implementation\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":322,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:37:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":3652,\"cache_read_tokens\":147255,\"output_tokens\":441,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Gemini Implementation**\\n\\nI\'ve been examining the `server/geminiClient.ts` file, specifically the `getGemini` function. Currently, I\'m focusing on the instance creation logic, especially the handling of the `GEMINI_API_KEY` and the `httpOptions` configuration. It seems like the implementation is sound so far.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/server/config.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing server/config.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check server config constants\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":324,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:37:55Z\",\"input_tokens\":3004,\"cache_read_tokens\":148873,\"output_tokens\":242,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Update Gemini model names to gemini-3.8-flash and gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"6\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update model constants in server/config.ts\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"export const MODEL_FLASH = \'gemini-3.8-flash\';\\\\nexport const MODEL_PRO = \'gemini-3.8-flash\';\\\\nexport const MODEL_TTS = \'gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts\';\\\"\",\"StartLine\":\"4\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"export const MODEL_FLASH = \'gemini-2.5-flash\';\\\\nexport const MODEL_PRO = \'gemini-2.5-pro\';\\\\nexport const MODEL_TTS = \'gemini-2.5-flash\';\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/server/config.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating server/config.ts models\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update server model constants\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":326,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:38:04Z\",\"input_tokens\":2731,\"cache_read_tokens\":149772,\"output_tokens\":130,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/server/geminiClient.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"15\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing geminiClient.ts setup\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check gemini client setup\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":328,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:38:10Z\",\"input_tokens\":2590,\"cache_read_tokens\":150400,\"output_tokens\":339,\"thinking\":\"**Adding User-Agent Header**\\n\\nI\'m currently modifying `server/geminiClient.ts`. I\'m integrating the `httpOptions` object within the `getGemini()` function to incorporate the \'User-Agent\' header. I will also be including a check to log a clear message if the `GEMINI_API_KEY` is undefined, to improve error handling.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add httpOptions with User-Agent header in getGemini\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"11\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Update GoogleGenAI constructor with httpOptions\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"export function getGemini(): GoogleGenAI {\\\\n  if (!aiInstance) {\\\\n    aiInstance = new GoogleGenAI({\\\\n      apiKey: GEMINI_API_KEY,\\\\n      httpOptions: {\\\\n        headers: {\\\\n          \'User-Agent\': \'aistudio-build\',\\\\n        },\\\\n      },\\\\n    });\\\\n  }\\\\n \\n<truncated 23 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"6\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"export function getGemini(): GoogleGenAI {\\\\n  if (!aiInstance) {\\\\n    aiInstance = new GoogleGenAI({ apiKey: GEMINI_API_KEY });\\\\n  }\\\\n  return aiInstance;\\\\n}\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/server/geminiClient.ts\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating geminiClient.ts httpOptions\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add httpOptions to Gemini client\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":330,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE