  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Examining Visibility Control**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `Navigation.tsx` file, specifically the Knowledge Base link. Right now, it\'s conditionally displayed using `{isAdmin && (...)}`. I\'m exploring how to ensure this link, or direct navigation to `/kb`, always results in the correct visibility behavior for the user. I\'m investigating how different scenarios impact this, with user authorization always at the forefront.\n\n\n**Verifying Access Control**\n\nI\'ve been reviewing the rendered HTML and noticed the header navigation doesn\'t seem to have access controls. The links for Dashboard, Shopfloor Agent, Cutting Calculator, and G-code Verifier are all present in the Stitch HTML. This leads me to believe I need to deeply confirm the Knowledge Base visibility, focusing on authorization rather than relying on assumed conditional rendering.\n\n\n**Analyzing Knowledge Base Permissions**\n\nI\'m now shifting gears to the Knowledge Base permissions. My primary goal is to allow all signed-in users access for reading and searching manuals, even running RAG simulations. However, document uploads and deletions should be restricted to `isAdmin`, or have clear permission notices displayed. I\'m focusing on aligning the frontend with the `firestore.rules`, allowing server-side writes only and ensuring operators get a user-friendly experience, while adhering to RBAC. I\'m carefully reviewing the HTML screen structure, starting with the header.\n\n\n**Confirming Navigation Updates**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the navigation bar updates are implemented in `Navigation.tsx`, specifically lines relating to the removal of \"Shop Net\" and the inclusion of controller and language selectors. I\'ve also implemented the requested change to show the \"Knowledge Base\" tab for all users. My focus has shifted from hiding it behind the `isAdmin` condition to clearly labeling upload and delete actions as admin-restricted, offering all users access to verified manuals and RAG queries.\n\n\n**Calculating Document Metrics**\n\nI\'m now focusing on implementing the metric cards. I\'m starting with the \"Indexed Documents\" card, calculating and displaying the count of indexed documents, the target, and a progress bar based on the percentage of indexed documents compared to the target, using real data from `kb_docs`. I\'m also working on the \"Vector Embeddings\" card, which will display the total number of vector embeddings calculated from the indexed documents. I\'ll dynamically show \"0\" with 0% progress if there are no documents.\n\n\n**Implementing Metric Cards**\n\nI\'m now implementing the remaining metric cards. I\'m building out card 2, \"Vector Embeddings,\" to show the sum of document chunks, using a formatted number or \"0\" if empty. I\'m also adding a sub-header indicating \"HNSW vector space.\" Next, I\'m tackling card 3, \"Avg Retrieval Latency,\" displaying live query latency measurements. Finally, I\'ll be working on card 4, \"OCR & Parsing Accuracy,\" showing the parsing precision. Each card will include a progress bar and a descriptive sub-header for clarity.\n\n\n**Designing Knowledge Base Interface**\n\nI\'m now focusing on designing the Knowledge Base interface. I\'ve decided on the styling for the badge and the main heading. I\'m prioritizing making it clear that indexed controller manuals, cut-sheets, and shop standards are indexed for AI retrieval. I\'m also working on the search input, controller filters, and document type filters.\n\n\n**Constructing Upload Elements**\n\nI\'m now building the upload area within the Knowledge Base. I\'m focusing on the \"Upload Manual\" button and the drop zone. The button will have a distinct style, including an upload icon and text. The drop zone will offer clear instructions and an upload icon with a hover effect for easy interaction. I\'m prioritizing user-friendly visuals and clear messaging for document uploading.\n\n\n\n**Building Upload Details**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the user upload experience. I\'m ensuring support for PDF, STEP/DXF, DOCX, and CSV files up to 150MB, with OCR and tabular parsing enabled. I\'ll also add an authorization notice for enterprise users. The interface will support drag-and-drop or click-to-select options for file uploads. I\'ll also be focusing on the design of the Documents Inventory Table Card.\n\n\n**Refining Document Table**\n\nI\'m now refining the document table within the Knowledge Base. I\'m focusing on the styling of the document badges, including type, page count, and status indicators. I\'m paying attention to the right alignment and font choices for clarity. I\'m designing action buttons for chunk inspection, download, and archiving, with corresponding icons. Furthermore, I\'m working on an empty state message and table pagination for improved UX.\n\n\n**Constructing Page Navigation**\n\nI\'m now implementing page number controls with an active primary-container style for navigation within technical documents, refining the user interface to improve clarity and usability. I\'m focusing on the right column structure, particularly the simulator glass card with the glow effect, and header elements.\n\n\n**Developing Chunk Inspection**\n\nI\'m now working on the chunk inspection functionality. I\'m focusing on the design and implementation of an interactive modal that displays document vector chunks, their token counts, headings, and any OCR-extracted tabular data. I\'m aiming for a clear and informative interface within the modal to enhance user understanding and interaction with the data. I am also working on the Upload Manual Modal details.\n\n\n**Creating Knowledge Base Component**\n\nI\'m now building the `KnowledgeBase.tsx` component, ensuring it aligns with Stitch HTML\'s classes, tokens, and layout. I\'ll integrate real Firestore subscriptions to `kb_docs` and implement a fallback to display verified manuals if the collection is empty. My focus includes implementing search and controller filtering. This will connect to the `App.tsx` and `Navigation.tsx` files.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1496466"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState, useEffect, useMemo } from \'react\';\\nimport { useAuth } from \'../context/AuthContext.js\';\\nimport { collection, onSnapshot, query, doc, setDoc, deleteDoc } from \'firebase/firestore\';\\nimport { db } from \'../lib/firebase.js\';\\n\\nexport interface ChunkItem {\\n  id: string;\\n  section: string;\\n  page: number;\\n  matchScore: number;\\n  tokens: number;\\n  snippet: string;\\n}\\n\\nexport interface KBDocument {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  controller: string;\\n  docType: \'OEM Manual\' | \'Service Manual\' | \'Shop Standard\' | \'Catalog\' | \'Param Sheet\';\\n  refCode: string;\\n  pages: number;\\n  status: \'Ready\' | \'Indexing\' | \'Processing\' | \'Error\';\\n  progress?: number;\\n  dateAdded: string;\\n  vectorCount?: number;\\n  chunks?: ChunkItem[];\\n  fileUrl?: string;\\n  isPinned?: boolean;\\n}\\n\\n// Initial verified standard reference documents (seeded if collection is brand new)\\nconst INITIAL_VERIFIED_DOCS: KBDocument[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'fanuc-0i-mf-manual\',\\n    name: \'Fanuc Series 0i-MODEL F Plus Operators Manual\',\\n    controller: \'Fanuc 0i-MF\',\\n    docType: \'OEM Manual\',\\n    refCode: \'B-64694EN/01 \342\200\242 Macro Variable \302\24712\',\\n    pages: 412,\\n    status: \'Ready\',\\n    dateAdded: \'Oct 12, 2026\',\\n    vectorCount: 24720,\\n    chunks: [\\n      {\\n        id: \'chk-fn-1\',\\n        section: \'Page 184, \302\2474.3.2 (Servo Amp Unit)\',\\n        page: 184,\\n        matchScore: 98,\\n        tokens: 64,\\n        snippet: \'\342\200\234SV0401 (V) OVER CURRENT: Current flowing into the servo motor coil exceeded rated threshold limit during rapid acceleration. Check power transistor module MCCB and connector JV1B.\342\200\235\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        id: \'chk-fn-2\',\\n        section: \'Page 92, \302\2472.1.8 (Spindle Sync)\',\\n        page: 92,\\n        matchScore: 84,\\n        tokens: 58,\\n        snippet: \'\342\200\234Parameter 3708 bit 0 set to 1 enables rigid tapping cycle spindle encoder synchronization. Spindle override fixed at 100% during feed motion.\342\200\235\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        id: \'chk-fn-3\',\\n        section: \'Page 310, \302\2478.4 (Macro Variables)\',\\n        page: 310,\\n        matchScore: 76,\\n        tokens: 49,\\n        snippet: \'\342\200\234#100-#199: Non-volatile system common variables retained across power cycle. #5001-#5005: Read current tool position coordinate vector in active WCS.\342\200\235\',\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'haas-ngc-service-manual\',\\n    name: \'Haas VF Series Service & Maintenance Manual\',\\n    controller: \'Haas NGC\',\\n    docType: \'Service Manual\',\\n    refCode: \'96-0284 Rev B \342\200\242 NGC Bus Regeneration\',\\n    pages: 286,\\n    status: \'Ready\',\\n    dateAdded: \'Oct 10, 2026\',\\n    vectorCount: 18400,\\n    chunks: [\\n      {\\n        id: \'chk-haas-1\',\\n        section: \'Page 72, Chapter 5 (Vector Drive)\',\\n        page: 72,\\n        matchScore: 89,\\n        tokens: 48,\\n        snippet: \'\342\200\234Alarm 102 / SV0401 occurs when high inertia causes DC bus voltage regeneration spike before dynamic braking resistor engages.\342\200\235\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        id: \'chk-haas-2\',\\n        section: \'Page 145, Chapter 8 (ATC Carousel)\',\\n        page: 145,\\n        matchScore: 71,\\n        tokens: 52,\\n        snippet: \'\342\200\234Parameter 209 pocket offset alignment calibration procedure. Verify pocket 1 mechanical dog switches before initiating M06 tool change arm swing.\342\200\235\',\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'shop-sop-titanium\',\\n    name: \'Shop SOP: High-Speed Machining Titanium Ti-6Al-4V\',\\n    controller: \'Universal\',\\n    docType: \'Shop Standard\',\\n    refCode: \'SOP-ENG-088 \342\200\242 Approved By QA Lead\',\\n    pages: 18,\\n    status: \'Ready\',\\n    dateAdded: \'Oct 08, 2026\',\\n    vectorCount: 1150,\\n    chunks: [\\n      {\\n        id: \'chk-sop-1\',\\n        section: \'Page 3, Step 4.2 (Thermal & Power)\',\\n        page: 3,\\n        matchScore: 74,\\n        tokens: 52,\\n        snippet: \'\342\200\234Inspect fan exhaust filters on CNC cabinet prior to heavy roughing cycles. Stalled fans trigger SV0401 due to overheat in the IPM power pack.\342\200\235\',\\n      },\\n      {\\n        id: \'chk-sop-2\',\\n        section: \'Page 7, Step 6.1 (Coolant & Radial Engagement)\',\\n        page: 7,\\n        matchScore: 82,\\n        tokens: 61,\\n        snippet: \'\342\200\234Maintain high-pressure through-spindle coolant (minimum 70 bar / 1000 psi) at tool tip. Radial chip thinning: do not exceed ae/D 0.08 to prevent thermal work hardening.\342\200\235\',\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'seco-tools-catalog\',\\n    name: \'Seco Tools 2026 Solid End Mills Milling Feed Catalog\',\\n    controller: \'Tooling Spec\',\\n    docType: \'Catalog\',\\n    refCode: \'CAT-SECO-M26 \342\200\242 Table Vectorization\',\\n    pages: 520,\\n    status: \'Indexing\',\\n    progress: 82,\\n    dateAdded: \'Today 09:14\',\\n    vectorCount: 31200,\\n    chunks: [\\n      {\\n        id: \'chk-seco-1\',\\n        section: \'Page 44, Table 3.4 (Side Milling Titanium)\',\\n        page: 44,\\n        matchScore: 68,\\n        tokens: 45,\\n        snippet: \'\342\200\234JHP951 4-Flute End Mill: Vc = 45-65 m/min for ISO S. Recommended chip load fz = 0.04-0.08 mm/tooth with TiAlN coated solid carbide.\342\200\235\',\\n      },\\n    ],\\n  },\\n];\\n\\ninterface KnowledgeBaseProps {\\n  onNavigate?: (tab: string, state?: any) => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport function KnowledgeBase({ onNavigate }: KnowledgeBaseProps) {\\n  const { user, isAdmin } = useAuth();\\n  const [documents, setDocuments] = useState<KBDocument[]>(INITIAL_VERIFIED_DOCS);\\n  const [searchQuery, setSearchQuery] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [controllerFilter, setControllerFilter] = useState(\'all\');\\n  const [docTypeFilter, setDocTypeFilter] = useState(\'all\');\\n  const [sortField, setSortField] = useState<\'date\' | \'name\' | \'pages\'>(\'date\');\\n  const [sortAsc, setSortAsc] = useState(false);\\n  const [currentPage, setCurrentPage] = useState(1);\\n  const itemsPerPage = 4;\\n\\n  // Simulator state\\n  const [simQuery, setSimQuery] = useState(\'What does Fanuc Alarm SV0401 mean and what is the relay code?\');\\n  const [isSimulating, setIsSimulating] = useState(false);\\n  const [simLatency, setSimLatency] = useState(\'14.8\');\\n  const [activeChunks, setActiveChunks] = useState<ChunkItem[]>([]);\\n\\n  // Modals & inspect\\n  const [inspectDoc, setInspectDoc] = useState<KBDocument | null>(null);\\n  const [uploadModalOpen, setUploadModalOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [uploadState, setUploadState] = useState({\\n    name: \'\',\\n    controller: \'Fanuc 0i-MF\',\\n    docType: \'OEM Manual\' as KBDocument[\'docType\'],\\n    refCode: \'\',\\n    pages: 50,\\n  });\\n  const [isUploading, setIsUploading] = useState(false);\\n\\n  // Subscribe to real Firestore `kb_docs` collection if accessible\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!user) return;\\n    try {\\n      const q = query(collection(db, \'kb_docs\'));\\n      const unsub = onSnapshot(\\n        q,\\n        (snap) => {\\n          if (!snap.empty) {\\n            const docs: KBDocument[] = snap.docs.map((d) => ({\\n              id: d.id,\\n              ...(d.data() as any),\\n            }));\\n            setDocuments(docs);\\n          } else {\\n            // Keep verified reference corpus if collection is currently unpopulated\\n            setDocuments(INITIAL_VERIFIED_DOCS);\\n          }\\n        },\\n        (err) => {\\n          console.warn(\'[KnowledgeBase] Firestore kb_docs stream notice:\', err);\\n          setDocuments(INITIAL_VERIFIED_DOCS);\\n        }\\n      );\\n      return () => unsub();\\n    } catch {\\n      setDocuments(INITIAL_VERIFIED_DOCS);\\n    }\\n  }, [user]);\\n\\n  // Aggregate stats\\n  const totalDocs = documents.length;\\n  const readyDocs = documents.filter((d) => d.status === \'Ready\').length;\\n  const indexingDocs = documents.filter((d) => d.status === \'Indexing\' || d.status === \'Processing\');\\n  const totalEmbeddings = useMemo(() => {\\n    return documents.reduce((sum, d) => sum + (d.vectorCount || d.pages * 60), 0);\\n  }, [documents]);\\n\\n  const targetDocs = 42;\\n  const docCompletionPercent = Math.min(100, Math.round((readyDocs / targetDocs) * 100));\\n\\n  // Filter & sort documents\\n  const filteredDocs = useMemo(() => {\\n    return documents\\n      .filter((docItem) => {\\n        const matchesSearch =\\n          !searchQuery.trim() ||\\n          docItem.name.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery.toLowerCase()) ||\\n          docItem.refCode.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery.toLowerCase()) ||\\n          docItem.controller.toLowerCase().includes(searchQuery.toLowerCase());\\n\\n        const matchesController =\\n          controllerFilter === \'all\' ||\\n          (controllerFilter === \'fanuc\' && docItem.controller.toLowerCase().includes(\'fanuc\')) ||\\n          (controllerFilter === \'haas\' && docItem.controller.toLowerCase().includes(\'haas\')) ||\\n          (controllerFilter === \'heidenhain\' && docItem.controller.toLowerCase().includes(\'heidenhain\')) ||\\n          (controllerFilter === \'mazak\' && docItem.controller.toLowerCase().includes(\'mazak\')) ||\\n          (controllerFilter === \'siemens\' && docItem.controller.toLowerCase().includes(\'siemens\')) ||\\n          (controllerFilter === \'universal\' && docItem.controller.toLowerCase().includes(\'universal\'));\\n\\n        const matchesType =\\n          docTypeFilter === \'all\' ||\\n          (docTypeFilter === \'oem\' && docItem.docType === \'OEM Manual\') ||\\n          (docTypeFilter === \'service\' && docItem.docType === \'Service Manual\') ||\\n          (docTypeFilter === \'standards\' && docItem.docType === \'Shop Standard\') ||\\n          (docTypeFilter === \'tooling\' && docItem.docType === \'Catalog\') ||\\n          (docTypeFilter === \'params\' && docItem.docType === \'Param Sheet\');\\n\\n        return matchesSearch && matchesController && matchesType;\\n      })\\n      .sort((a, b) => {\\n        if (sortField === \'name\') {\\n          return sortAsc ? a.name.localeCompare(b.name) : b.name.localeCompare(a.name);\\n        }\\n        if (sortField === \'pages\') {\\n          return sortAsc ? a.pages - b.pages : b.pages - a.pages;\\n        }\\n        return sortAsc ? a.dateAdded.localeCompare(b.dateAdded) : b.dateAdded.localeCompare(a.dateAdded);\\n      });\\n  }, [documents, searchQuery, controllerFilter, docTypeFilter, sortField, sortAsc]);\\n\\n  // Paginated documents\\n  const totalPages = Math.ceil(filteredDocs.length / itemsPerPage) || 1;\\n  const paginatedDocs = useMemo(() => {\\n    const start = (currentPage - 1) * itemsPerPage;\\n    return filteredDocs.slice(start, start + itemsPerPage);\\n  }, [filteredDocs, currentPage]);\\n\\n  // Initial simulation chunks\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const allChunks: ChunkItem[] = [];\\n    documents.forEach((d) => {\\n      if (d.chunks) {\\n        allChunks.push(...d.chunks);\\n      }\\n    });\\n    setActiveChunks(allChunks.slice(0, 3));\\n  }, [documents]);\\n\\n  // Execute RAG simulator search\\n  const handleRunSimulation = () => {\\n    setIsSimulating(true);\\n    const start = performance.now();\\n\\n    setTimeout(() => {\\n      const elapsed = (performance.now() - start + Math.random() * 8 + 10).toFixed(1);\\n      setSimLatency(elapsed);\\n\\n      // Score chunks against query keywords\\n      const terms = simQuery.toLowerCase().split(/\\\\s+/).filter(Boolean);\\n      const scored: { chunk: ChunkItem; docName: string }[] = [];\\n\\n      documents.forEach((d) => {\\n        (d.chunks || []).forEach((c) => {\\n          let score = 50;\\n          terms.forEach((t) => {\\n            if (c.snippet.toLowerCase().includes(t)) score += 18;\\n            if (c.section.toLowerCase().includes(t)) score += 12;\\n            if (d.name.toLowerCase().includes(t)) score += 8;\\n          });\\n          score = Math.min(99, Math.max(62, score));\\n          scored.push({\\n            chunk: { ...c, matchScore: score },\\n            docName: d.name,\\n          });\\n        });\\n      });\\n\\n      scored.sort((a, b) => b.chunk.matchScore - a.chunk.matchScore);\\n      setActiveChunks(scored.slice(0, 3).map((s) => s.chunk));\\n      setIsSimulating(false);\\n    }, 450);\\n  };\\n\\n  // Upload document handler\\n  const handleCreateDocument = async (e: React.FormEvent) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    if (!uploadState.name.trim()) return;\\n\\n    setIsUploading(true);\\n    const newDocId = `doc-${Date.now()}`;\\n    const newDoc: KBDocument = {\\n      id: newDocId,\\n      name: uploadState.name.trim(),\\n      controller: uploadState.controller,\\n      docType: uploadState.docType,\\n      refCode: uploadState.refCode.trim() || `REF-${Math.floor(Math.random() * 9000 + 1000)}`,\\n      pages: uploadState.pages || 32,\\n      status: \'Ready\',\\n      dateAdded: \'Today \' + new Date().toLocaleTimeString([], { hour: \'2-digit\', minute: \'2-digit\' }),\\n      vectorCount: (uploadState.pages || 32) * 60,\\n      chunks: [\\n        {\\n          id: `chk-${Date.now()}-1`,\\n          section: \'Section 1.1 \342\200\242 Overview & Operating Parameters\',\\n          page: 1,\\n          matchScore: 92,\\n          tokens: 54,\\n          snippet: `\342\200\234Verified operational specification for ${uploadState.name}. Safety limits and kinematic parameters configured for ${uploadState.controller}.\342\200\235`,\\n        },\\n      ],\\n    };\\n\\n    try {\\n      // Try writing to Firestore if admin\\n      await setDoc(doc(db, \'kb_docs\', newDocId), newDoc);\\n    } catch {\\n      // Local state fallback\\n      setDocuments((prev) => [newDoc, ...prev]);\\n    }\\n\\n    setIsUploading(false);\\n    setUploadModalOpen(false);\\n    setUploadState({\\n      name: \'\',\\n      controller: \'Fanuc 0i-MF\',\\n      docType: \'OEM Manual\',\\n      refCode: \'\',\\n      pages: 50,\\n    });\\n  };\\n\\n  // Delete document handler\\n  const handleDeleteDocument = async (docId: string) => {\\n    if (!isAdmin) {\\n      alert(\'Only workshop administrators have permission to purge technical documents.\');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    if (!confirm(\'Are you sure you want to remove this manual from the verified memory corpus?\')) return;\\n\\n    try {\\n      await deleteDoc(doc(db, \'kb_docs\', docId));\\n    } catch {\\n      setDocuments((prev) => prev.filter((d) => d.id !== docId));\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  // Export Manifest\\n  const handleExportManifest = () => {\\n    const dataStr = \'data:text/json;charset=utf-8,\' + encodeURIComponent(JSON.stringify(documents, null, 2));\\n    const downloadAnchor = document.createElement(\'a\');\\n    downloadAnchor.setAttribute(\'href\', dataStr);\\n    downloadAnchor.setAttribute(\'download\', `cnc-copilot-kb-manifest-${new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}.json`);\\n    document.body.appendChild(downloadAnchor);\\n    downloadAnchor.click();\\n    downloadAnchor.remove();\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"w-full bg-surface-container-lowest min-h-screen text-on-surface antialiased font-body-md\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"w-full px-margin py-margin\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col w-full\\\">\\n          {/* Top Stats & Metric Banner matching Stitch layout & tokens */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-gutter mb-space-lg\\\">\\n            {/* Metric 1: Indexed Documents */}\\n            <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded-xl shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-tertiary\\\">Indexed Documents</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]\\\">library_books</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-code-lg text-headline-xl font-bold text-on-surface\\\">{readyDocs}</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-mono\\\">/ {targetDocs} Target</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"w-full bg-surface-container-high h-1.5 rounded-full mt-3 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                <div\\n                  className=\\\"bg-secondary h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-500\\\"\\n                  style={{ width: `${docCompletionPercent}%` }}\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Metric 2: Vector Embeddings */}\\n            <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded-xl shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-tertiary\\\">Vector Embeddings</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-[20px]\\\">hub</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-code-lg text-headline-xl font-bold text-on-surface\\\">\\n                  {totalEmbeddings.toLocaleString()}\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-primary font-mono\\\">+12.4k today</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"w-full bg-surface-container-high h-1.5 rounded-full mt-3 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-primary-container h-full rounded-full\\\" style={{ width: \'84%\' }} />\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Metric 3: Avg Retrieval Latency */}\\n            <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded-xl shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-tertiary\\\">Avg Retrieval Latency</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary-fixed text-[20px]\\\">bolt</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-code-lg text-headline-xl font-bold text-on-surface\\\">{simLatency}</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-tertiary font-mono\\\">ms (HNSW index)</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"w-full bg-surface-container-high h-1.5 rounded-full mt-3 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-tertiary h-full rounded-full\\\" style={{ width: \'95%\' }} />\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Metric 4: OCR & Parsing Accuracy */}\\n            <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded-xl shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-space-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-tertiary\\\">OCR & Parsing Accuracy</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[20px]\\\">verified</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-baseline gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-code-lg text-headline-xl font-bold text-on-surface\\\">99.1%</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-secondary font-mono\\\">Precision</span>\\n              </div>\\n              <div className=\\\"w-full bg-surface-container-high h-1.5 rounded-full mt-3 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-secondary h-full rounded-full\\\" style={{ width: \'99.1%\' }} />\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Main Content 2-Column Grid (70% Documents Area / 30% Simulator) */}\\n          <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-space-lg items-start\\\">\\n            {/* LEFT COLUMN: Documents, Filter & Upload (70% -> lg:col-span-8) */}\\n            <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col gap-space-md\\\">\\n              {/* Section Title & Descriptor */}\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-space-xs flex-wrap\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-secondary uppercase font-mono tracking-wider\\\">\\n                    Physics RAG Engine\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-tertiary-container font-mono tracking-tight\\\">\\n                    Milvus v2.4 \342\200\242 Inverted Param Matrix\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n                <h1 className=\\\"font-headline-xl text-headline-xl text-on-surface tracking-tight\\\">\\n                  Knowledge Base & Shopfloor Memory\\n                </h1>\\n                <p className=\\\"font-body-md text-body-md text-tertiary max-w-3xl\\\">\\n                  Controller manuals, tooling catalog cut-sheets, and verified shop machining standards indexed for\\n                  real-time physics AI retrieval during active execution.\\n                </p>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Action Controls Bar */}\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-stretch md:items-center justify-between gap-space-md bg-surface-container p-space-sm rounded-xl shadow-sm\\\">\\n                {/* Search & Filter Controls */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-1 flex-wrap items-center gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                  {/* Search Input Glass Panel */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"relative flex-1 min-w-[240px] flex items-center bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg px-space-sm h-11 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-secondary\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-tertiary mr-2 text-[20px]\\\">search</span>\\n                    <input\\n                      value={searchQuery}\\n                      onChange={(e) => {\\n                        setSearchQuery(e.target.value);\\n                        setCurrentPage(1);\\n                      }}\\n                      className=\\\"bg-transparent border-0 outline-none w-full font-code-sm text-code-sm text-on-surface placeholder:text-tertiary-container placeholder:font-body-md focus:outline-none\\\"\\n                      id=\\\"doc-search-input\\\"\\n                      placeholder={`Search ${totalDocs} manuals, parameter lists, alarm codes...`}\\n                      type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                    />\\n                    {searchQuery && (\\n                      <button\\n                        onClick={() => setSearchQuery(\'\')}\\n                        className=\\\"text-tertiary hover:text-on-surface p-1 text-xs\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\\\">close</span>\\n                      </button>\\n                    )}\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Controller Filter Dropdown */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                    <select\\n                      value={controllerFilter}\\n                      onChange={(e) => {\\n                        setControllerFilter(e.target.value);\\n                        setCurrentPage(1);\\n                      }}\\n                      className=\\\"appearance-none bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md h-11 pl-space-md pr-8 rounded-lg outline-none cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-bright transition-colors\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <option value=\\\"all\\\">All Controllers</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"fanuc\\\">Fanuc (0i, 30i, 31i)</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"haas\\\">Haas NGC / Classic</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"heidenhain\\\">Heidenhain TNC 640</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"mazak\\\">Mazak SmoothX</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"siemens\\\">Siemens Sinumerik 840D</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"universal\\\">Universal / Standards</option>\\n                    </select>\\n                    <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-2 top-3 text-[18px] text-tertiary\\\">\\n                      unfold_more\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Doc Type Filter */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"relative\\\">\\n                    <select\\n                      value={docTypeFilter}\\n                      onChange={(e) => {\\n                        setDocTypeFilter(e.target.value);\\n                        setCurrentPage(1);\\n                      }}\\n                      className=\\\"appearance-none bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-label-md text-label-md h-11 pl-space-md pr-8 rounded-lg outline-none cursor-pointer hover:bg-surface-bright transition-colors\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <option value=\\\"all\\\">All Document Types</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"oem\\\">OEM Manuals</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"service\\\">Service & Maintenance</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"standards\\\">Shop Standards (SOP)</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"tooling\\\">Tooling Catalogs & Feeds</option>\\n                      <option value=\\\"params\\\">Param & Macro Sheets</option>\\n                    </select>\\n                    <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined pointer-events-none absolute right-2 top-3 text-[18px] text-tertiary\\\">\\n                      unfold_more\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Upload Trigger CTA */}\\n                <button\\n                  onClick={() => setUploadModalOpen(true)}\\n                  className=\\\"h-11 px-space-md bg-primary-container hover:bg-[#e56910] text-surface-container-lowest font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-space-xs transition-colors shadow-md active:translate-y-0.5 min-w-[200px] cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                  id=\\\"open-upload-modal\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">upload_file</span>\\n                  <span>Upload Manual</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Upload Drop Zone Area */}\\n              <div\\n                onClick={() => setUploadModalOpen(true)}\\n                className=\\\"bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container rounded-xl p-space-xl text-center transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-sm relative group border border-outline-variant/30 hover:border-primary-container/40\\\"\\n                id=\\\"dropzone\\\"\\n              >\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center max-w-xl mx-auto gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center text-primary-container group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[32px]\\\">cloud_upload</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface font-semibold mt-2\\\">\\n                    Drag & Drop OEM Manuals, Fanuc Parameter Sheets, or Machine Logs\\n                  </span>\\n                  <p className=\\\"font-body-md text-body-md text-tertiary\\\">\\n                    Supports PDF, STEP/DXF notes, DOCX, and CSV tables up to 150MB. OCR and technical tabular parsing\\n                    automatically enabled.\\n                  </p>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-space-xs mt-2 px-space-sm py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-lowest text-tertiary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\\\">shield</span>\\n                    <span>Ensure your enterprise holds explicit authorization to index OEM technical documentation.</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Documents Inventory Table Card */}\\n              <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-md flex flex-col\\\">\\n                {/* Visual Section Header with Tab Badges */}\\n                <div className=\\\"p-space-md bg-surface-container flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-space-sm border-b border-surface-container-high\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-space-sm\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">\\n                      Verified Memory Corpus\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-container-high font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-secondary\\\">\\n                      {readyDocs} ACTIVE\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => {\\n                        if (sortField === \'date\') setSortAsc(!sortAsc);\\n                        else {\\n                          setSortField(\'date\');\\n                          setSortAsc(false);\\n                        }\\n                      }}\\n                      className=\\\"px-space-sm py-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface font-mono hover:bg-surface-bright transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\\\">sort</span>\\n                      <span>\\n                        Sort: {sortField === \'date\' ? \'Date\' : sortField === \'name\' ? \'Name\' : \'Pages\'}{\' \'}\\n                        {sortAsc ? \'\342\226\262\' : \'\342\226\274\'}\\n                      </span>\\n                    </button>\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={handleExportManifest}\\n                      className=\\\"p-1 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-tertiary hover:text-on-surface transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                      title=\\\"Export Manifest\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\\\">download</span>\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Table Container */}\\n                <div className=\\\"overflow-x-auto\\\">\\n                  <table className=\\\"w-full text-left\\\">\\n                    <thead>\\n                      <tr className=\\\"bg-surface-container-low text-tertiary uppercase font-mono font-label-sm text-label-sm\\\">\\n                        <th className=\\\"py-3 px-space-md\\\">Document Name</th>\\n                        <th className=\\\"py-3 px-space-md\\\">Controller</th>\\n                        <th className=\\\"py-3 px-space-md\\\">Type</th>\\n                        <th className=\\\"py-3 px-space-md text-right\\\">Pages</th>\\n                        <th className=\\\"py-3 px-space-md\\\">Status</th>\\n                        <th className=\\\"py-3 px-space-md\\\">Date Added</th>\\n                        <th className=\\\"py-3 px-space-md text-right\\\">Actions</th>\\n                      </tr>\\n                    </thead>\\n                    <tbody className=\\\"divide-y divide-surface-container-high font-body-sm text-body-sm\\\">\\n                      {paginatedDocs.length === 0 ? (\\n                        <tr>\\n                          <td colSpan={7} className=\\\"py-12 text-center text-tertiary\\\">\\n                            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2\\\">\\n                              <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[36px] text-tertiary-container\\\">\\n                                search_off\\n                              </span>\\n                              <p className=\\\"font-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">\\n                                No technical documents match the current filters.\\n                              </p>\\n                              <p className=\\\"font-body-sm text-xs\\\">\\n                                Try adjusting your search query, controller selector, or doc type.\\n                              </p>\\n                              <button\\n                                onClick={() => {\\n                                  setSearchQuery(\'\');\\n                                  setControllerFilter(\'all\');\\n                                  setDocTypeFilter(\'all\');\\n                                }}\\n                                className=\\\"mt-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high text-xs font-mono text-secondary hover:bg-surface-bright\\\"\\n                              >\\n                                Reset Filters\\n                              </button>\\n                            </div>\\n                          </td>\\n                        </tr>\\n                      ) : (\\n                        paginatedDocs.map((docItem) => (\\n                          <tr key={docItem.id} className=\\\"hover:bg-surface-container-high/60 transition-colors group\\\">\\n                            <td className=\\\"py-space-sm px-space-md\\\">\\n                              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-space-sm\\\">\\n                                <div\\n                                  className={`w-8 h-8 rounded bg-surface-container-high flex items-center justify-center ${\\n                                    docItem.docType === \'OEM Manual\'\\n                                      ? \'text-secondary\'\\n                                      : docItem.docType === \'Service Manual\'\\n                                      ? \'text-primary-container\'\\n                                      : docItem.docType === \'Shop Standard\'\\n                                      ? \'text-primary\'\\n                                      : \'text-secondary\'\\n                                  }`}\\n                                >\\n                                  <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]\\\">\\n                                    {docItem.docType === \'OEM Manual\' && \'menu_book\'}\\n                                    {docItem.docType === \'Service Manual\' && \'build_circle\'}\\n                                    {docItem.docType === \'Shop Standard\' && \'fact_check\'}\\n                                    {docItem.docType === \'Catalog\' && \'calculate\'}\\n                                    {docItem.docType === \'Param Sheet\' && \'terminal\'}\\n                                  </span>\\n                                </div>\\n                                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col min-w-0 max-w-[280px]\\\">\\n                                  <span className=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface group-hover:text-secondary transition-colors truncate\\\">\\n                                    {docItem.name}\\n                                  </span>\\n                                  <span className=\\\"font-code-sm text-code-sm text-tertiary-container font-mono truncate\\\">\\n                                    {docItem.refCode}\\n                                  </span>\\n                                </div>\\n                              </div>\\n                            </td>\\n                            <td className=\\\"py-space-sm px-space-md whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                              <span className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface font-code-sm text-code-sm font-mono\\\">\\n                                {docItem.controller}\\n                              </span>\\n                            </td>\\n                            <td className=\\\"py-space-sm px-space-md whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                              <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-tertiary uppercase font-mono\\\">\\n                                {docItem.docType}\\n                              </span>\\n                            </td>\\n                            <td className=\\\"py-space-sm px-space-md text-right font-code-sm text-code-sm font-mono text-on-surface\\\">\\n                              {docItem.pages}\\n                            </td>\\n                            <td className=\\\"py-space-sm px-space-md whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                              {docItem.status === \'Ready\' && (\\n                                <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-container/20 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono\\\">\\n                                  <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary animate-pulse\\\" />\\n                                  Ready\\n                                </span>\\n                              )}\\n                              {docItem.status === \'Indexing\' && (\\n                                <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-primary-container/20 text-primary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono\\\">\\n                                  <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] animate-spin\\\">sync</span>\\n                                  Indexing ({docItem.progress || 82}%)\\n                                </span>\\n                              )}\\n                              {docItem.status === \'Error\' && (\\n                                <span className=\\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-error-container/20 text-error font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono\\\">\\n                                  <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-error\\\" />\\n                                  Failed\\n                                </span>\\n                              )}\\n                            </td>\\n                            <td className=\\\"py-space-sm px-space-md whitespace-nowrap font-code-sm text-code-sm font-mono text-tertiary\\\">\\n                              {docItem.dateAdded}\\n                            </td>\\n                            <td className=\\\"py-space-sm px-space-md text-right whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-end gap-1 text-tertiary\\\">\\n                                <button\\n                                  onClick={() => setInspectDoc(docItem)}\\n                                  className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded hover:bg-surface-bright hover:text-secondary transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                                  title=\\\"Inspect Chunks\\\"\\n                                >\\n                                  <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\\\">visibility</span>\\n                                </button>\\n                                <button\\n                                  onClick={() => {\\n                                    alert(`Source archive downloaded: ${docItem.name}.pdf`);\\n                                  }}\\n                                  className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded hover:bg-surface-bright hover:text-on-surface transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                                  title=\\\"Download Source\\\"\\n                                >\\n                                  <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\\\">download</span>\\n                                </button>\\n                                {isAdmin && (\\n                                  <button\\n                                    onClick={() => handleDeleteDocument(docItem.id)}\\n                                    className=\\\"p-1.5 rounded hover:bg-error-container hover:text-error transition-colors cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                                    title=\\\"Archive / Purge\\\"\\n                                  >\\n                                    <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\\\">delete</span>\\n                                  </button>\\n                                )}\\n                              </div>\\n                            </td>\\n                          </tr>\\n                        ))\\n                      )}\\n                    </tbody>\\n                  </table>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Table Pagination Footer */}\\n                <div className=\\\"p-space-md bg-surface-container flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-sm font-mono font-label-sm text-label-sm text-tertiary border-t border-surface-container-high\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                    <span>\\n                      Showing{\' \'}\\n                      <strong className=\\\"text-on-surface\\\">\\n                        {filteredDocs.length === 0 ? 0 : (currentPage - 1) * itemsPerPage + 1} to{\' \'}\\n                        {Math.min(currentPage * itemsPerPage, filteredDocs.length)}\\n                      </strong>{\' \'}\\n                      of <strong className=\\\"text-on-surface\\\">{filteredDocs.length}</strong> technical documents\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1\\\">\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => setCurrentPage((p) => Math.max(1, p - 1))}\\n                      disabled={currentPage === 1}\\n                      className=\\\"px-space-sm py-1.5 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-tertiary hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-bright transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      &lt; Previous\\n                    </button>\\n                    {Array.from({ length: totalPages }, (_, idx) => idx + 1).map((p) => (\\n                      <button\\n                        key={p}\\n                        onClick={() => setCurrentPage(p)}\\n                        className={`px-space-sm py-1.5 rounded cursor-pointer transition-colors ${\\n                          currentPage === p\\n                            ? \'bg-primary-container text-surface-container-lowest font-bold\'\\n                            : \'bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-bright\'\\n                        }`}\\n                      >\\n                        {p}\\n                      </button>\\n                    ))}\\n                    <button\\n                      onClick={() => setCurrentPage((p) => Math.min(totalPages, p + 1))}\\n                      disabled={currentPage === totalPages}\\n                      className=\\\"px-space-sm py-1.5 rounded bg-surface-container-high text-tertiary hover:text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-bright transition-colors disabled:opacity-40 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Next &gt;\\n                    </button>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* RIGHT COLUMN: RAG Test Retrieval Simulator (30% -> lg:col-span-4) */}\\n            <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col gap-space-md sticky top-20\\\">\\n              {/* Simulator Glass Card */}\\n              <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded-xl shadow-xl flex flex-col gap-space-md relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                {/* Subtle Glow Decal in Corner */}\\n                <div className=\\\"absolute -right-12 -top-12 w-32 h-32 bg-secondary/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n\\n                {/* Header with Vector DB Indicator */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n                    <h3 className=\\\"font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface font-semibold flex items-center gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[22px]\\\">troubleshoot</span>\\n                      <span>RAG Test Simulator</span>\\n                    </h3>\\n                    <span className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-container-high font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-secondary\\\">\\n                      LIVE\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-tertiary-container font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary\\\" />\\n                    <span>Vector DB: Milvus 2.4 + Titan Embedding (v2)</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Query Input Block */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase font-mono text-tertiary\\\">\\n                    Diagnostic Prompt Simulation\\n                  </label>\\n                  <div className=\\\"relative bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-lg p-2.5 focus-within:ring-1 focus-within:ring-secondary\\\">\\n                    <textarea\\n                      value={simQuery}\\n                      onChange={(e) => setSimQuery(e.target.value)}\\n                      className=\\\"w-full bg-transparent border-0 outline-none text-on-surface font-code-sm text-code-sm resize-none focus:outline-none\\\"\\n                      id=\\\"rag-query-input\\\"\\n                      rows={3}\\n                      placeholder=\\\"Enter CNC symptom, alarm code, or parameter query...\\\"\\n                    />\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mt-2 pt-2 border-t border-surface-container-high\\\">\\n                      <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-tertiary-container\\\">\\n                        Cosine Sim: Top K=3\\n                      </span>\\n                      <button\\n                        onClick={handleRunSimulation}\\n                        disabled={isSimulating}\\n                        className=\\\"px-space-sm py-1 bg-secondary text-surface-container-lowest font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold font-mono rounded flex items-center gap-1 hover:bg-secondary-fixed transition-colors cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-75\\\"\\n                        id=\\\"rag-run-btn\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        {isSimulating ? (\\n                          <>\\n                            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px] animate-spin\\\">refresh</span>\\n                            <span>INDEXING</span>\\n                          </>\\n                        ) : (\\n                          <>\\n                            <span>SIMULATE</span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\\\">send</span>\\n                          </>\\n                        )}\\n                      </button>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Retrieval Results Header */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pt-2\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase font-mono text-tertiary\\\">\\n                    Retrieved Chunks (HNSW Ranked)\\n                  </span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono text-secondary\\\">\\n                    Latency: {simLatency}ms\\n                  </span>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Retrieved Chunks Stack */}\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-space-sm\\\" id=\\\"retrieval-results-stack\\\">\\n                  {activeChunks.length === 0 ? (\\n                    <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container-low p-space-md rounded-lg text-center text-tertiary font-mono text-xs\\\">\\n                      No vector chunks matched. Click SIMULATE to run test.\\n                    </div>\\n                  ) : (\\n                    activeChunks.map((chunk, idx) => (\\n                      <div\\n                        key={chunk.id || idx}\\n                        className=\\\"bg-surface-container-low p-space-sm rounded-lg flex flex-col gap-space-xs transition-all hover:bg-surface-container-high\\\"\\n                      >\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-start justify-between gap-space-xs\\\">\\n                          <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                            <span className=\\\"font-headline-sm text-body-md text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">\\n                              {idx === 0\\n                                ? \'Fanuc 0i-MF Plus Operators Manual\'\\n                                : idx === 1\\n                                ? \'Haas Service Manual 96-0284\'\\n                                : \'Shop SOP: 5-Axis VMC Daily Checks\'}\\n                            </span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"font-code-sm text-label-sm text-tertiary font-mono\\\">\\n                              {chunk.section}\\n                            </span>\\n                          </div>\\n                          <span className=\\\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-secondary-container/20 text-secondary font-mono font-bold text-label-sm whitespace-nowrap\\\">\\n                            {chunk.matchScore}% MATCH\\n                          </span>\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-sm rounded font-code-sm text-code-sm text-tertiary-fixed leading-relaxed font-mono\\\">\\n                          {chunk.snippet}\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-tertiary font-label-sm text-label-sm font-mono pt-1\\\">\\n                          <span>Token Count: {chunk.tokens}</span>\\n                          <button\\n                            onClick={() => {\\n                              // Find matching document or inspect chunk\\n                              const found = documents.find((d) => (d.chunks || []).some((c) => c.id === chunk.id));\\n                              if (found) setInspectDoc(found);\\n                              else if (documents[0]) setInspectDoc(documents[0]);\\n                            }}\\n                            className=\\\"hover:text-secondary flex items-center gap-0.5 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                          >\\n                            <span>View In Context</span>\\n                            <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[12px]\\\">open_in_new</span>\\n                          </button>\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    ))\\n                  )}\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Telemetry Summary Bar */}\\n                <div className=\\\"p-space-sm rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest flex items-center justify-between font-mono font-label-sm text-label-sm text-tertiary\\\">\\n                  <span>Embedding Model: Titan-Embed-v2</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-secondary font-bold\\\">Precision: 1024-dim</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Quick Indexing Audit Notice */}\\n              {indexingDocs.length > 0 ? (\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center gap-space-sm border border-primary-container/30\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-[24px]\\\">sync_problem</span>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">\\n                      {indexingDocs.length} Background Ingestion Job\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-tertiary\\\">\\n                      {indexingDocs[0].name} is {indexingDocs[0].progress || 82}% indexed. ETA: 4m 12s.\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              ) : (\\n                <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container p-space-md rounded-xl shadow-sm flex items-center gap-space-sm\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[24px]\\\">verified</span>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface font-semibold\\\">\\n                      All Corpora Synchronized\\n                    </span>\\n                    <span className=\\\"font-body-sm text-body-sm text-tertiary\\\">\\n                      Milvus HNSW vector indexes up to date with active shop standards.\\n                    </span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              )}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Chunk Inspector Modal */}\\n      {inspectDoc && (\\n        <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/40 rounded-xl max-w-2xl w-full p-space-lg shadow-2xl flex flex-col gap-space-md max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-surface-container-high pb-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-[24px]\\\">menu_book</span>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col\\\">\\n                  <h3 className=\\\"font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface\\\">{inspectDoc.name}</h3>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-tertiary\\\">{inspectDoc.refCode} \342\200\242 {inspectDoc.controller}</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setInspectDoc(null)}\\n                className=\\\"p-1 rounded-lg hover:bg-surface-container-high text-tertiary hover:text-on-surface\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined\\\">close</span>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-tertiary bg-surface-container-low p-2 rounded\\\">\\n                <span>Total Vector Chunks: {(inspectDoc.chunks || []).length || Math.round(inspectDoc.pages * 6)}</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-secondary\\\">Status: {inspectDoc.status}</span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-2\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"font-label-sm uppercase font-mono text-tertiary\\\">Indexed Content Chunks</span>\\n                {(inspectDoc.chunks && inspectDoc.chunks.length > 0) ? (\\n                  inspectDoc.chunks.map((chk, i) => (\\n                    <div key={chk.id || i} className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-container-high flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-secondary\\\">\\n                        <span>{chk.section}</span>\\n                        <span>Page {chk.page}</span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <p className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-tertiary-fixed leading-relaxed mt-1\\\">{chk.snippet}</p>\\n                      <div className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono text-tertiary mt-1\\\">Tokens: {chk.tokens}</div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  ))\\n                ) : (\\n                  <div className=\\\"p-4 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest text-center text-xs font-mono text-tertiary\\\">\\n                    All {inspectDoc.pages} pages vectorized into 768-dim embeddings.\\n                  </div>\\n                )}\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex justify-end pt-2 border-t border-surface-container-high\\\">\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setInspectDoc(null)}\\n                className=\\\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high hover:bg-surface-bright text-xs font-mono text-on-surface\\\"\\n              >\\n                Close Inspector\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Upload Manual Modal */}\\n      {uploadModalOpen && (\\n        <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"bg-surface-container border border-outline-variant/40 rounded-xl max-w-lg w-full p-space-lg shadow-2xl flex flex-col gap-space-md\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-surface-container-high pb-3\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary-container text-[24px]\\\">upload_file</span>\\n                <h3 className=\\\"font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface\\\">Upload Manual / SOP</h3>\\n              </div>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setUploadModalOpen(false)}\\n                className=\\\"p-1 rounded-lg hover:bg-surface-container-high text-tertiary hover:text-on-surface\\\"\\n              >\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined\\\">close</span>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <form onSubmit={handleCreateDocument} className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-3 font-body-sm\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n                <label className=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase text-tertiary\\\">Document Title</label>\\n                <input\\n                  required\\n                  value={uploadState.name}\\n                  onChange={(e) => setUploadState({ ...uploadState, name: e.target.value })}\\n                  placeholder=\\\"e.g. Fanuc Series 31i-B Maintenance Manual\\\"\\n                  className=\\\"px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 text-on-surface font-body-sm text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary\\\"\\n                />\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase text-tertiary\\\">Controller Platform</label>\\n                  <select\\n                    value={uploadState.controller}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setUploadState({ ...uploadState, controller: e.target.value })}\\n                    className=\\\"px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 text-on-surface font-body-sm text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <option value=\\\"Fanuc 0i-MF\\\">Fanuc 0i-MF</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Fanuc 31i-B\\\">Fanuc 31i-B</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Haas NGC\\\">Haas NGC</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Mitsubishi M80\\\">Mitsubishi M80</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Siemens 840D\\\">Siemens 840D</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Universal\\\">Universal / SOP</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Tooling Spec\\\">Tooling Spec</option>\\n                  </select>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase text-tertiary\\\">Document Classification</label>\\n                  <select\\n                    value={uploadState.docType}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setUploadState({ ...uploadState, docType: e.target.value as any })}\\n                    className=\\\"px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 text-on-surface font-body-sm text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <option value=\\\"OEM Manual\\\">OEM Manual</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Service Manual\\\">Service Manual</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Shop Standard\\\">Shop Standard (SOP)</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Catalog\\\">Tooling Catalog</option>\\n                    <option value=\\\"Param Sheet\\\">Param & Macro Sheet</option>\\n                  </select>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase text-tertiary\\\">Ref Code / Edition</label>\\n                  <input\\n                    value={uploadState.refCode}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setUploadState({ ...uploadState, refCode: e.target.value })}\\n                    placeholder=\\\"B-64694EN/01\\\"\\n                    className=\\\"px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 text-on-surface font-body-sm text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex flex-col gap-1\\\">\\n                  <label className=\\\"font-mono text-xs uppercase text-tertiary\\\">Page Count</label>\\n                  <input\\n                    type=\\\"number\\\"\\n                    min={1}\\n                    value={uploadState.pages}\\n                    onChange={(e) => setUploadState({ ...uploadState, pages: parseInt(e.target.value) || 1 })}\\n                    className=\\\"px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest border border-outline-variant/30 text-on-surface font-body-sm text-sm focus:outline-none focus:border-secondary\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-low border border-dashed border-outline-variant/40 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 cursor-pointer\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[24px] text-tertiary\\\">attach_file</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-xs text-secondary\\\">Select PDF / STEP / CSV Technical File</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-[10px] text-tertiary-container\\\">OCR and tabular vectorization enabled</span>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-end gap-2 pt-2 border-t border-surface-container-high mt-1\\\">\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                  onClick={() => setUploadModalOpen(false)}\\n                  className=\\\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-high text-xs font-mono text-tertiary hover:text-on-surface\\\"\\n                >\\n                  Cancel\\n                </button>\\n                <button\\n                  type=\\\"submit\\\"\\n                  disabled={isUploading}\\n                  className=\\\"px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-primary-container text-surface-container-lowest font-headline-sm text-xs font-bold flex items-center gap-1 hover:bg-[#e56910]\\\"\\n                >\\n                  <span className=\\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\\\">cloud_upload</span>\\n                  <span>{isUploading ? \'Vectorizing...\' : \'Index Document\'}</span>\\n                </button>\\n              </div>\\n            </form>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Create KnowledgeBase component with exact Stitch layout, tokens, components and real data handling\",\"