olumn)**:\n   - **Live Simulator Card**: Interactive diagnostic query input with vector DB indicator and top-k cosine similarity trigger.\n   - **Interactive Retrieval Run**: Executes simulated semantic ranking with live latency timing, returning ranked vector chunks with match percentages, section markers, code excerpts, token counts, and \"View in Context\" actions.\n   - **Ingestion Audit Notice**: Dynamic alert reflecting background indexing jobs and synchronization status.\n\n### Files Changed:\n- `src/components/KnowledgeBase.tsx` *(new component)*\n- `src/App.tsx` *(wired KnowledgeBase component to the `kb` tab)*\n- `src/components/Navigation.tsx` *(enabled Knowledge Base navigation link with admin indicators)*"
