    response: "The **G-code Syntax & Collision Verifier** screen has been implemented to match the Stitch HTML layout, components, tokens, and real-data requirements:\n\n### Layout & Component Implementations\n\n1. **Top Metric & KPI Banner (4 Strip Cards)**:\n   - **Safety Audit Status**: Real-time evaluation of modal states, tool length compensation, and travel clearance (100% Pre-Flight Pass vs Critical Collisions / Warnings).\n   - **Parsed Motion Blocks**: Accurate counts of total program blocks with live breakdown between cutting feeds (`G01`/`G02`/`G03`) and rapid traverses (`G00`).\n   - **Work Envelope Bounds**: Dynamic min/max calculation for X, Y, and Z travel ranges derived directly from parsed coordinates.\n   - **Kinematic Peak Rates**: Maximum spindle RPM (`S`), peak table feed rate (`F`), and active `G43` height compensation status.\n\n2. **Pre-Flight Verification Scenarios & Presets**:\n   - `O1001 \342\200\224 Safe Facing & Helical Pocket`: Clean pass with verified G43 height compensation and safe Z plane.\n   - `O1002 \342\200\224 Rapid Plunge Crash Risk`: Trapping dangerous `G00` traverse plunging into negative Z with concurrent XY motion.\n   - `O1003 \342\200\224 Missing G43 Offset`: Catching tool change (`T02`) without height compensation prior to Z engagement.\n   - `O1004 \342\200\224 Spindle Off Cutting Feed`: Flagging cutting motion (`G01`) while spindle rotation is stopped (`M05`).\n   - `O1005 \342\200\224 Rigid Tapping Pitch Discrepancy`: Verifying `G84` feed vs spindle speed and thread pitch synchronicity.\n   - Custom `.NC`, `.TAP`, `.EIA`, `.GCODE`, and `.TXT` file upload support with instant syntax parsing.\n\n3. **G-Code Program Inspector & Syntax Gutter**:\n   - Monospace line-numbered gutter with issue beacons (pulsing red for `CRITICAL`, amber for `WARNING`).\n   - Modal state indicator bar displaying active `G90 ABS`, `G17 XY`, `G21 MM`, `G54 WCS`, and `G43` status.\n   - Interactive line selection: clicking any finding jumps directly to and highlights that block in the editor.\n\n4. **3D Kinematic Toolpath Backplot**:\n   - Built with Three.js (`@react-three/fiber` and `@react-three/drei`).\n   - Glowing cyan trajectories for cutting feeds (`#5DE6FF`) and amber paths for rapid traverses (`#FBBF24`).\n   - Workpiece stock envelope, table work plane grid, and `G54` origin reference triad (Red X, Green Y, Blue Z).\n   - Dynamic collision beacons highlighting hazardous coordinates in 3D space.\n   - Full playback controls: Step Backward, Play / Pause simulation, Step Forward, scrub slider, speed multiplier (`1x`, `2x`, `5x`), and viewport angle buttons (`ISO`, `TOP XY`, `FRONT XZ`).\n\n5. **Pre-Flight Findings & Audit Filtering**:\n   - Filter chips for `ALL`, `CRITICAL`, `WARNINGS`, and `INFO`.\n   - Actionable finding cards with severity badge, line number, rule code, plain-language hazard explanation, and \"Jump to Line\" shortcuts.\n   - Activity logging to `users/{uid}/activity` upon program verification, syncing the Operator Dashboard\'s \"Programs verified today\" chip and 7-day Copilot activity chart.\n\n### Files Changed:\n- `src/components/GCodeVerifier.tsx` *(new component)*\n- `src/App.tsx` *(mounted `GCodeVerifier` for the `gcode` tab)*"
