elity canvas, and plotting different colors for feed, rapids, and error markers. I\'m also including controls for view manipulation and simulation. Moreover, I\'m integrating pre-flight findings with severity tabs.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/app/applet/src/engine/gcode.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"259\",\"StartLine\":\"100\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing engine/gcode.ts lines 100-259\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read gcode engine rules\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":370,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:58:08Z\",\"input_tokens\":3834,\"cache_read_tokens\":36511,\"output_tokens\":149,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/engine/gcode.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"259\",\"StartLine\":\"100\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing /src/engine/gcode.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Read engine gcode rules\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":372,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:58:19Z\",\"input_tokens\":2663,\"cache_read_tokens\":40315,\"output_tokens\":2133,\"thinking\":\"**Reviewing G-code Capabilities**\\n\\nI\'ve been examining the G-code parser within `src/engine/gcode.ts`. It\'s robust, handling G00, G01, G02, G03, along with arc centers specified as I, J, and R. I also verified the correct parsing of spindle commands (M03, M04, M05), feed rate (F), coordinates (X, Y, Z), and tool changes (Txx, M06).\\n\\n\\n**Analyzing HTML Structure**\\n\\nI\'m now diving into the Stitch HTML structure for the G-code verifier, specifically from the user\'s prompt. My focus is on matching its layout, co\\n<truncated 1752 bytes>\\ngate to flagged issues.\\n\\n\\n**Visualizing Toolpath Display**\\n\\nI am now focusing on the 3D toolpath visualization. I\'m building a Three.js (or high-precision Canvas/SVG) isometric renderer with a grid floor representing the G54 datum. I will represent rapid moves with amber dashed paths, and feed moves in glowing cyan. I will include a tool cursor, and render arcs smoothly. I\'m also including a collision warning beacon, with controls for stepping through code. I am focusing on making the controls intuitive.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/calculator/Calculator3DView.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Calculator3DView.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check Three.js usage\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":374,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:58:40Z\",\"input_tokens\":3194,\"cache_read_tokens\":43571,\"output_tokens\":100,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/package.json\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing package.json\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check installed dependencies\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":376,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:58:46Z\",\"input_tokens\":3071,\"cache_read_tokens\":44643,\"output_tokens\":81,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/index.css\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"140\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing src/index.css\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check CSS tokens\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":378,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:58:50Z\",\"input_tokens\":2858,\"cache_read_tokens\":47650,\"output_tokens\":121,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/calculator/CuttingCalculator.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"145\",\"StartLine\":\"100\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing CuttingCalculator explain call\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check activity logging and explain API\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":380,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:58:59Z\",\"input_tokens\":3032,\"cache_read_tokens\":48392,\"output_tokens\":87,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/calculator/CuttingCalculator.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"99\",\"StartLine\":\"60\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing logCalculation in CuttingCalculator\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check activity logging pattern\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":382,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:59:03Z\",\"input_tokens\":2951,\"cache_read_tokens\":49311,\"output_tokens\":89,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/calculator/CuttingCalculator.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"35\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing activity write in CuttingCalculator\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check activity doc schema\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":384,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:59:07Z\",\"input_tokens\":2817,\"cache_read_tokens\":50153,\"output_tokens\":329,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing Program Actions**\\n\\nI\'m focusing on how program actions are logged and displayed. I\'ve noted the Operator Dashboard\'s metrics for \\\"Questions,\\\" \\\"Calculations,\\\" and \\\"Programs Verified.\\\" I\'m connecting these to the \\\"Recent Activity\\\" tabs, specifically how filtering by type (Calculations, Alarms, Simulations) reveals program activity. Now I\'m drilling down into the specific data.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/server.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing server.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Inspect server.ts\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":386,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:59:14Z\",\"input_tokens\":3223,\"cache_read_tokens\":50935,\"output_tokens\":70,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/server/routes/explain.ts\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"80\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing explain.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check explainRouter implementation\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":388,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:59:17Z\",\"input_tokens\":3571,\"cache_read_tokens\":52034,\"output_tokens\":1306,\"thinking\":\"**Considering API Endpoints**\\n\\nI\'m currently evaluating the potential for adding or supporting `/api/gcode/explain` within `server/routes/explain.ts`. However, I need to stay within the existing constraints and ensure that no changes are made to server logic, authentication, rate limiting, or Firestore rules. The only allowed output are the files I changed.\\n\\n\\n**Analyzing G-code Verifier**\\n\\nI\'ve shifted focus to designing the G-code verifier\'s UI components. I\'m exploring the provided Stitch HTML for layout \\n<truncated 871 bytes>\\nng Toolpaths**\\n\\nI\'m now focusing on the 3D toolpath visualizer. I envision using `OrbitControls` to display a stock workpiece and a G54 work origin triad. I\'ll represent rapid paths with amber dashed lines and cutting feed paths with cyan glowing lines. I\'m prioritizing smooth arc segment interpolation and an active tool tip indicator. View presets and playback controls are also on my list, including step back/forward, play/pause, and a block slider. I will be sure to consider a speed multiplier as well.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/Hero3DScene.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"60\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Hero3DScene.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check Hero3DScene three.js setup\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\"]}\n{\"step_index\":390,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T08:59:32Z\",\"input_tokens\":2405,\"cache_read_tokens\":55960,\"output_tokens\":17999,\"thinking\":\"**Designing the Toolpath Backplot**\\n\\nI\'m making progress mapping segments from `parseAndVerifyGCode`. Rapid segments are rendered with yellow/amber. Linear moves will be blue, and arcs are green. I\'m focusing on the visual representation, keeping it clean, and lightweight with Three.js\' `<line>` and meshes through `@react-three/fiber`.\\n\\n\\n**Visualizing the Code Execution**\\n\\nI\'m now focusing on a clear visual language. Feed segments will be cyan, and I\'ll use a triad to mark the origin. I\'m also considering a\\n<truncated 1433 bytes>\\nn empty state for the editor.\\n\\n\\n**Constructing the Core Component**\\n\\nI\'m now writing the `GCodeVerifier.tsx` component, focusing on the empty state when no program is loaded, or when the user clears the code. I\'ve designed a clear message with prompts to \\\"Paste ISO-6983 G-code, load a shopfloor verification preset, or upload an NC file.\\\" Buttons will prompt \\\"Load Clean Facing Preset\\\" and \\\"Upload .NC File.\\\" I am also listing necessary imports and planning a 3D subcomponent, considering coordinate scaling.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React, { useState, useEffect, useMemo, useRef } from \'react\';\\\\nimport { Canvas, useFrame } from \'@react-three/fiber\';\\\\nimport { OrbitControls } from \'@react-three/drei\';\\\\nimport * as THREE from \'three\';\\\\nimport { useAuth } from \'../context/AuthCont\\n<truncated 57503 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create GCodeVerifier component matching Stitch layout, tokens, components, 3D backplot, and real data constraints\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/GCodeVerifier.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Writing GCodeVerifier.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create GCodeVerifier component\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"thinking\",\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":392,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:01:30Z\",\"input_tokens\":18589,\"cache_read_tokens\":58429,\"output_tokens\":116,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"85\",\"StartLine\":\"60\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing App.tsx around line 60-85\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check gcode tab render in App.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":394,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:01:36Z\",\"input_tokens\":2880,\"cache_read_tokens\":74887,\"output_tokens\":73,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"25\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing App.tsx imports\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check imports in App.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":396,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:01:45Z\",\"input_tokens\":2837,\"cache_read_tokens\":75638,\"output_tokens\":213,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Import GCodeVerifier in App.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"8\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add GCodeVerifier import in App.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"import { CuttingCalculator } from \'./components/calculator/CuttingCalculator.js\';\\\\nimport { KnowledgeBase } from \'./components/KnowledgeBase.js\';\\\\nimport { GCodeVerifier } from \'./components/GCodeVerifier.js\';\\\"\",\"StartLine\":\"6\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"import { CuttingCalculator } from \'./components/calculator/CuttingCalculator.js\';\\\\nimport { KnowledgeBase } from \'./components/KnowledgeBase.js\';\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Importing GCodeVerifier\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Import GCodeVerifier in App.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":398,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:01:56Z\",\"input_tokens\":2614,\"cache_read_tokens\":76352,\"output_tokens\":479,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Render GCodeVerifier component in App.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"88\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Replace gcode placeholder with GCodeVerifier in App.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"        {currentTab === \'gcode\' && (\\\\n          <GCodeVerifier onNavigate={handleNavigate} />\\\\n        )}\\\"\",\"StartLine\":\"68\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"        {currentTab === \'gcode\' && (\\\\n          <div className=\\\\\\\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin py-8\\\\\\\">\\\\n            <div className=\\\\\\\"bg-surface-container-low p-8 rounded-xl border border-outline-variant/30 text-center flex flex-col items-center justify-cent\\n<truncated 1009 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Rendering GCodeVerifier component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Render GCodeVerifier in App.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":400,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:02:13Z\",\"input_tokens\":3180,\"cache_read_tokens\":76831,\"output_tokens\":50,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Linting codebase\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run lint_applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":402,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:02:34Z\",\"input_tokens\":2264,\"cache_read_tokens\":77898,\"output_tokens\":62,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run compile_applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":404,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:02:44Z\",\"input_tokens\":2257,\"cache_read_tokens\":78049,\"output_tokens\":43,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"restart_dev_server\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Restarting dev server\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Restart server\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":406,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:02:48Z\",\"input_tokens\":2234,\"cache_read_tokens\":78194,\"output_tokens\":97,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"sleep 1 && curl -s http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/health\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/app/applet\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"3000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Testing health check\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Health check curl\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":408,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:02:54Z\",\"input_tokens\":2338,\"cache_read_tokens\":78314,\"output_tokens\":89,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598/task-407\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking health check status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check task status\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":411,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:02:56Z\",\"input_tokens\":2570,\"cache_read_tokens\":78533,\"output_tokens\":78,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"git status -s\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/app/applet\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"2000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking git status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check changed files\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":413,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:03:00Z\",\"input_tokens\":2294,\"cache_read_tokens\":78991,\"output_tokens\":930,\"content\":\"The **G-code Syntax & Collision Verifier** screen has been implemented to match the Stitch HTML layout, components, tokens, and real-data requirements:\\n\\n### Layout & Component Implementations\\n\\n1. **Top Metric & KPI Banner (4 Strip Cards)**:\\n   - **Safety Audit Status**: Real-time evaluation of modal states, tool length compensation, and travel clearance (100% Pre-Flight Pass vs Critical Collisions / Warnings).\\n   - **Parsed Motion Blocks**: Accurate counts of total program blocks with live breakdown between\\n<truncated 2117 bytes>\\n Filter chips for `ALL`, `CRITICAL`, `WARNINGS`, and `INFO`.\\n   - Actionable finding cards with severity badge, line number, rule code, plain-language hazard explanation, and \\\"Jump to Line\\\" shortcuts.\\n   - Activity logging to `users/{uid}/activity` upon program verification, syncing the Operator Dashboard\'s \\\"Programs verified today\\\" chip and 7-day Copilot activity chart.\\n\\n### Files Changed:\\n- `src/components/GCodeVerifier.tsx` *(new component)*\\n- `src/App.tsx` *(mounted `GCodeVerifier` for the `gcode` tab)*\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":338,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:20:36Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nThe /agent page renders completely blank. Do not add features. Do this only:\\n1. Wrap every route in a React ErrorBoundary that, on error, shows the error message, the component stack and the file name on screen in a red GlassPanel, instead of a blank page.\\n2. Add window.onerror and unhandledrejection handlers that show the same panel.\\n3. Check whether any file imported by the /agent page (directly or indirectly) imports server-only code: @google/genai, firebase-admin, fs, path, or anything fr\\n<truncated 427 bytes>\\ns: 2026-10-16T02:20:36-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nUser Email: biju0716@gmail.com\\nThe user\'s firestore db is ai-studio-cnccopilot-3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598 and you must always load the firebase skill when processing queries that require interacting with the database or Firebase services.\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":339,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:20:36Z\",\"input_tokens\":24077,\"cache_read_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":346,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Requirements**\\n\\nI\'m currently dissecting the user\'s explicit instructions, meticulously isolating the core requirement: implementing an error boundary on the `/agent` route. My focus is on ensuring I understand the constraints. They want a specific error handling mechanism for that route only, without additional feature creep. The key is the presentation of the error data.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/src\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing src directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List src directory\\\"\"}}]}"
