  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Main Entry Point**\n\nI\'m now examining `src/main.tsx`, the application\'s entry point. I\'ve noted the use of `createRoot` from `react-dom/client`, the import of `App` component and `index.css`, and how the root element is targeted. This seems like a standard React setup for mounting the application, but I\'ll make sure it follows the conventions.\n\n\n**Implementing Error Handling**\n\nI\'ve decided to add an emergency pre-mount error handler. This will prevent a blank screen in case of fatal bootstrap issues. I\'m injecting the handler right at the top of `main.tsx` before React renders, so if a critical error occurs during script loading or before React mounts, it\'ll be caught. This will use the \"root\" element from the `main.tsx` file.\n\n\n**Refining Error Display**\n\nI\'ve crafted a styled, visually distinct error display for critical failures. This uses a modal with a red-themed design to grab attention. The error message will now be clearly visible, along with the source file and even a stack trace, if available, so I can more readily pinpoint issues.\n\n\n**Enhancing Error Presentation**\n\nI\'ve significantly improved the error display. The new style uses a dark background and red accents for higher visibility, including a prominent button to return to the dashboard. The modal displays the error message, source file, and stack trace in a readable format.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1748931"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import { createRoot } from \'react-dom/client\';\\nimport App from \'./App.js\';\\nimport \'./index.css\';\\n\\n// Emergency pre-mount error handler to prevent blank screen in fatal bootstrap scenarios\\nif (typeof window !== \'undefined\') {\\n  const mountEmergencyPanel = (msg: string, source?: string, stack?: string) => {\\n    const root = document.getElementById(\'root\');\\n    if (root && (!root.hasChildNodes() || root.innerHTML.trim() === \'\')) {\\n      const displayFile = (source || \'Client Bootstrap\').replace(/^https?:\\\\/\\\\/[^/]+/, \'\');\\n      root.innerHTML = `\\n        <div style=\\\"min-height: 100vh; background-color: #0a0e13; color: #fee2e2; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 1.5rem; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"max-width: 56rem; width: 100%; border-radius: 1rem; background: rgba(69, 10, 10, 0.75); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.5); padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.35);\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.25); padding-bottom: 1rem;\\\">\\n              <span style=\\\"font-size: 1.5rem;\\\">\342\232\240\357\270\217</span>\\n              <div>\\n                <h2 style=\\\"font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fecaca; margin: 0;\\\">Application Runtime Exception</h2>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-size: 0.75rem; color: #fca5a5; font-family: monospace; margin-top: 0.25rem;\\\">Source File: ${displayFile}</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.8125rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3); word-break: break-all;\\\">\\n              ${msg}\\n            </div>\\n            ${stack ? `<pre style=\\\"font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.7rem; color: #fca5a5; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding: 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; max-height: 200px; overflow: auto; white-space: pre-wrap;\\\">${stack}</pre>` : \'\'}\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\\\">\\n              <button onclick=\\\"window.location.href=\'/\'\\\" style=\\\"background: rgba(239,68,68,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.6); color: white; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; cursor: pointer;\\\">Return to Dashboard</button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      `;\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  window.addEventListener(\'error\', (event) => {\\n    mountEmergencyPanel(event.message || \'Script execution error\', event.filename, event.error?.stack);\\n  });\\n  window.addEventListener(\'unhandledrejection\', (event) => {\\n    const reason = event.reason;\\n    mountEmergencyPanel(\\n      reason instanceof Error ? reason.message : String(reason),\\n      reason instanceof Error && (reason as any).fileName ? (reason as any).fileName : \'Async Pipeline\',\\n      reason instanceof Error ? reason.stack : undefined\\n    );\\n  });\\n}\\n\\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\'root\')!).render(<App />);\\n\",\"Description\":\"Add emergency pre-mount error handler to main.tsx to eliminate blank screens\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/main.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating main.tsx\",\"toolSummary\":\"Add bootstrap error handler in main.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 12
      nanos: 67729286
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    provider_assigned_message_id: "o-7RarXXLN-wqtsPrJ2r6A8"
  }
