toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing components directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List components directory\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":485,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:31:31Z\",\"input_tokens\":2434,\"cache_read_tokens\":109238,\"output_tokens\":98,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598/task-484\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking task 484 status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check task 484 status\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":488,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:31:34Z\",\"input_tokens\":3023,\"cache_read_tokens\":109405,\"output_tokens\":1048,\"content\":\"Here is the itemized summary of what was found and changed across the 5 requirements:\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 1. Route ErrorBoundaries with Red GlassPanel\\n* **Created `src/components/RedGlassPanel.tsx`**:\\n  - Implemented an industrial red GlassPanel (`bg-red-950/70 backdrop-blur-xl border border-red-500/50 text-red-100 shadow-[0_12px_40px_rgba(239,68,68,0.35)]`) displaying:\\n    1. **Error Message**: Prominent, formatted error message box.\\n    2. **Component Stack & Call Stack**: Interactive, expandable mono view of the R\\n<truncated 2704 bytes>\\nypeof latest.title === \'string\' ? latest.title : \'\'` to eliminate potential `Cannot read properties of undefined (reading \'match\')` crashes when activity titles are undefined.\\n  - Added `(activities || [])` fallback across all chat metrics and stat computations.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Verification\\n- `npm run lint` (`tsc --noEmit`): Passed with zero type or syntax errors.\\n- `compile_applet` (`vite build`): Built and compiled successfully.\\n- Dev server tested and confirmed returning `200 OK` on `/agent` and `/api/health`.\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":341,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:36:11Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nFix the errors in the app\\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\\nfix_it_trigger: manual\\nerror 0: [unhandledrejection caught]: {\\\"reason\\\":{},\\\"file\\\":\\\"Client Runtime (Vite)\\\"}\\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-16T02:36:11-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nUser Email: biju0716@gmail.com\\nThe user\'s firestore db is ai-studio-cnccopilot-3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598 and you must always load the firebase skill when processing queries that require interacting with the database or Firebase services.\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\"}\n{\"step_index\":342,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:36:11Z\",\"input_tokens\":10529,\"cache_read_tokens\":18628,\"output_tokens\":290,\"thinking\":\"**Addressing the Errors**\\n\\nI\'ve isolated an \\\"unhandledrejection\\\" error originating in the client runtime environment. The specific \\\"reason\\\" object is currently empty, but I\'m tracking the issue back to the Vite build process. I\'m focusing on tracing this null error code further.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/GlobalErrorHandler.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"100\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing GlobalErrorHandler.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View GlobalErrorHandler.tsx\\\"\"}}]}"
