 I\'ve noted the conditions based on substrings within the error messages (like \"resizeobserver\", \"client is offline\", and others). I want to evaluate if these criteria are sufficient and haven\'t introduced any issues. I\'m also checking the logic within the `mountEmergencyPanel` function itself and how it makes a determination on when to trigger the error panel.\n\n\n"
