  planner_response {
    response: "### Fix Summary\n\n1. **Root Cause Identified**:\n   - The global `unhandledrejection` handler was intercepting harmless environment-level WebSocket/HMR disconnect rejections from Vite (`@vite/client`), which occur in AI Studio where HMR is disabled.\n   - When logging these rejections with `console.error(\'[unhandledrejection caught]:\', { reason, file })`, the serialization of the Error object resulted in `{\"reason\":{},\"file\":\"Client Runtime (Vite)\"}` and falsely triggered the test suite\'s runtime error monitor.\n   - Additionally, an automatic top-level `testConnection()` call in `src/lib/firebase.ts` made an unauthorized query on boot against `/test/connection` that triggered permission denials.\n\n2. **Changes Applied**:\n   - **`src/components/GlobalErrorHandler.tsx`**:\n     - Added `isIgnorableError()` to filter out benign environment warnings (WebSocket disconnections, Vite HMR, and ResizeObserver notifications) per runtime environment guidelines (`HMR: Disabled. Ignore WebSocket errors.`).\n     - Enhanced logging to provide explicit error messages, source file paths, and stack traces when legitimate application-level exceptions occur.\n   - **`src/main.tsx`**:\n     - Updated the pre-mount emergency panel handlers to ignore benign WebSocket/HMR connection events before React hydrates.\n   - **`src/lib/firebase.ts`**:\n     - Removed the top-level unconditional `testConnection()` invocation on module import.\n\n3. **Verification**:\n   - Verified TypeScript compilation with `lint_applet` (0 errors).\n   - Verified production build with `compile_applet` (success).\n   - Dev server restarted and confirmed all routes (`/`, `/agent`, `/api/health`) respond with HTTP 200."
    modified_response: "### Fix Summary\n\n1. **Root Cause Identified**:\n   - The global `unhandledrejection` handler was intercepting harmless environment-level WebSocket/HMR disconnect rejections from Vite (`@vite/client`), which occur in AI Studio where HMR is disabled.\n   - When logging these rejections with `console.error(\'[unhandledrejection caught]:\', { reason, file })`, the serialization of the Error object resulted in `{\"reason\":{},\"file\":\"Client Runtime (Vite)\"}` and falsely triggered the test suite\'s runtime error monitor.\n   - Additionally, an automatic top-level `testConnection()` call in `src/lib/firebase.ts` made an unauthorized query on boot against `/test/connection` that triggered permission denials.\n\n2. **Changes Applied**:\n   - **`src/components/GlobalErrorHandler.tsx`**:\n     - Added `isIgnorableError()` to filter out benign environment warnings (WebSocket disconnections, Vite HMR, and ResizeObserver notifications) per runtime environment guidelines (`HMR: Disabled. Ignore WebSocket errors.`).\n     - Enhanced logging to provide explicit error messages, source file paths, and stack traces when legitimate application-level exceptions occur.\n   - **`src/main.tsx`**:\n     - Updated the pre-mount emergency panel handlers to ignore benign WebSocket/HMR connection events before React hydrates.\n   - **`src/lib/firebase.ts`**:\n     - Removed the top-level unconditional `testConnection()` invocation on module import.\n\n3. **Verification**:\n   - Verified TypeScript compilation with `lint_applet` (0 errors).\n   - Verified production build with `compile_applet` (success).\n   - Dev server restarted and confirmed all routes (`/`, `/agent`, `/api/health`) respond with HTTP 200."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
    thinking_signature: "\022\241\002\n\236\002\001i\024}\023oq\217\353\021\210\354M?0\023QQ7J\351(\266\330f(\220\257\376U4\250\fi\326/\366\t8\271Co\2525\223\003\227s\030p\360\361\322m\233\324I\321:XGS\352/\353\275,\306j9\350\3435\370)\331\241\302\212C\371\220\325\203X\017\201\b\222\025\316&\376G\221Y6M\314\251\276k\250\370\237\206\241\b\232\357\223\330\267\306\270\a\032\003e\363v\333C\035\3532+\037Mu\\\312~\322\304\230\373\245KI\362\330\254\337l\027\304\337\000\213|\021\037g\256\341\232\337\327\314\233\242\344\f\267A\221\036\231\247\326\215\334{&y\201\307\317\305\376/e\210\263Q\272\030|VeK,\307j\037M\226\367\211\326\305\342\002\316\305\024E\330+\027~\223tc\203\217s\303\264!\203\\RJ\351R\304\033\372\245\302yrU\033\265\246,}\021/\246\273\266\370\2535\203\033$\305\t\336F\335\346\027l\\\nw\000iH\3457\202\000Wo\210#\0269\264\037\221%Z\000\336\371<jI"
