e.ts\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Remove top-level testConnection invocation\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":460,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:45:06Z\",\"input_tokens\":2860,\"cache_read_tokens\":106734,\"output_tokens\":49,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Linting codebase\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run lint_applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":462,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:45:16Z\",\"input_tokens\":2342,\"cache_read_tokens\":107402,\"output_tokens\":60,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run compile_applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":464,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:45:22Z\",\"input_tokens\":2333,\"cache_read_tokens\":107553,\"output_tokens\":59,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"restart_dev_server\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Restarting dev server\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Restart dev server\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":466,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:45:25Z\",\"input_tokens\":2328,\"cache_read_tokens\":107696,\"output_tokens\":195,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"curl -s -o /dev/null -w \\\\\\\"%{http_code}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\" http://127.0.0.1:3000/ http://127.0.0.1:3000/agent http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/health\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/app/applet\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"3000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Testing endpoints\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Test endpoints\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":468,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:45:32Z\",\"input_tokens\":2572,\"cache_read_tokens\":107821,\"output_tokens\":98,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598/task-467\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking task 467 status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check task 467\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":471,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:45:34Z\",\"input_tokens\":3211,\"cache_read_tokens\":108156,\"output_tokens\":428,\"content\":\"### Fix Summary\\n\\n1. **Root Cause Identified**:\\n   - The global `unhandledrejection` handler was intercepting harmless environment-level WebSocket/HMR disconnect rejections from Vite (`@vite/client`), which occur in AI Studio where HMR is disabled.\\n   - When logging these rejections with `console.error(\'[unhandledrejection caught]:\', { reason, file })`, the serialization of the Error object resulted in `{\\\"reason\\\":{},\\\"file\\\":\\\"Client Runtime (Vite)\\\"}` and falsely triggered the test suite\'s runtime error monitor\\n<truncated 660 bytes>\\n`**:\\n     - Updated the pre-mount emergency panel handlers to ignore benign WebSocket/HMR connection events before React hydrates.\\n   - **`src/lib/firebase.ts`**:\\n     - Removed the top-level unconditional `testConnection()` invocation on module import.\\n\\n3. **Verification**:\\n   - Verified TypeScript compilation with `lint_applet` (0 errors).\\n   - Verified production build with `compile_applet` (success).\\n   - Dev server restarted and confirmed all routes (`/`, `/agent`, `/api/health`) respond with HTTP 200.\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":341,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:51:40Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nshopfloor agent page is still blank\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-16T02:51:40-07:00.\\n\\nThe user has uploaded 1 image(s):\\n- Screenshot 2026-10-16 at 3.20.48\342\200\257PM.png\\nYou can embed this image in an artifact if you need the USER to review it.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nUser Email: biju0716@gmail.com\\nThe user\'s firestore db is ai-studio-cnccopilot-3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598 and you must always load the firebase skill when processing queries that require interacting with the database or Firebase services.\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"media\":[{\"mime_type\":\"image/png\",\"uri\":\"Screenshot 2026-10-16 at 3.20.48\342\200\257PM.png\"}]}\n{\"step_index\":342,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:51:40Z\",\"input_tokens\":15433,\"cache_read_tokens\":19253,\"output_tokens\":337,\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing the Blank Page**\\n\\nI\'m currently focused on the blank Shopfloor Agent page. I\'ve examined the screenshot; the navigation bar indicates I am in the correct section, so it\'s likely a loading or rendering issue. I\'ll need to investigate what\'s happening behind the scenes to determine if there\'s a problem fetching data or with the front-end components.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/pages/AgentPage.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"100\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing AgentPage.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View AgentPage.tsx\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":344,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T09:51:47Z\",\"input_tokens\":2651,\"cache_read_tokens\":32605,\"output_tokens\":63,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"list_dir\",\"args\":{\"DirectoryPath\":\"\\\"/src\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Listing src directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"List src directory\\\"\"}}]}"
