 integrating features of the `ShopfloorAgent.tsx` component. This includes the controller selector, the camera/OCR image upload feature (with webcam and file input options), and the voice/audio input toggle. In the UI I am adding quick alarm presets to assist with common controller error codes. The component will also have interactive chat history functionality.\n\n\n"
