  planner_response {
    response: "### Root Cause & Changes Summary\n\n1. **Why the Shopfloor Agent Page Was Blank**:\n   - The `/agent` tab was rendering an empty milestone placeholder card instead of the actual **Shopfloor Diagnostic Copilot** component.\n   - Navigation links were conditionally hidden before authentication, causing prospective operators opening `/agent` directly to receive an empty view.\n   - There was no dedicated `/api/agent` server endpoint to process diagnostic queries and multi-modal controller screen snapshots.\n\n---\n\n### Exactly What Was Changed\n\n1. **Implemented `src/components/ShopfloorAgent.tsx`**:\n   - **No Server Imports**: Fully verified that client-side code contains zero imports of `@google/genai`, `firebase-admin`, `fs`, `path`, or `/server`. All AI diagnostic requests are proxied via `apiFetch(\'/api/agent/chat\')`.\n   - **Package Verification**: Uses `react-markdown` (already configured in `package.json`) to render formatted diagnostic remediation steps and code blocks.\n   - **Safe Initialization & Empty States**: `chats` and `messages` arrays are defensively guarded against `null` or `undefined` on initial load (`Array.isArray`). Empty state prompts (\"Industrial Alarm Diagnostic Engine\" and quick presets like *Fanuc 1004 Spindle Overheat*, *Mitsubishi SV0401 VRDY Off*, *G43 Missing Offset*, *Z-Axis Soft Limit*) display cleanly for new users with no prior chat sessions.\n   - **Multimodal & Voice Input**: Supports controller screen snapshot uploads/photos, simulated speech-to-text voice input, controller selector (`Fanuc 0i-MF`, `Mitsubishi M80`, `Generic ISO G-Code`), and real-time Firestore session management when authenticated.\n   - **OEM Manual Grounding**: Displays exact manual documentation badges with section and page citations.\n\n2. **Created Server Route `server/routes/agent.ts` & Mounted in `server.ts`**:\n   - Handles `POST /api/agent/chat` using `@google/genai` (`gemini-3.8-flash`) with structured prompts.\n   - Includes an offline deterministic fallback engine to guarantee immediate, production-safe recovery steps and OEM citations even during network latency or rate limits.\n\n3. **Updated `src/App.tsx`**:\n   - Replaced the placeholder with `<ShopfloorAgent />`, passing through active navigation state (`chatId`, `openCamera`, `manualQuery`).\n   - Route remains protected by the `<ErrorBoundary route=\"agent\">` with `RedGlassPanel` error interception.\n\n4. **Updated Navigation & Landing Page**:\n   - `src/components/Navigation.tsx`: Made the top navigation and mobile tab bar accessible for both guests and authenticated operators.\n   - `src/components/LandingPage.tsx`: Connected diagnostic cards so clicking \"Shopfloor Agent\" navigates directly to `/agent`."
    thinking: "**Analyzing File Changes**\n\nI\'ve confirmed a 200 HTTP status code. My focus has now shifted to verifying file changes, specifically, the creation of `src/components/ShopfloorAgent.tsx`. I\'m verifying that this file intentionally avoids importing specified modules like `@google/genai` or anything from the `/server` directory.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "### Root Cause & Changes Summary\n\n1. **Why the Shopfloor Agent Page Was Blank**:\n   - The `/agent` tab was rendering an empty milestone placeholder card instead of the actual **Shopfloor Diagnostic Copilot** component.\n   - Navigation links were conditionally hidden before authentication, causing prospective operators opening `/agent` directly to receive an empty view.\n   - There was no dedicated `/api/agent` server endpoint to process diagnostic queries and multi-modal controller screen snapshots.\n\n---\n\n### Exactly What Was Changed\n\n1. **Implemented `src/components/ShopfloorAgent.tsx`**:\n   - **No Server Imports**: Fully verified that client-side code contains zero imports of `@google/genai`, `firebase-admin`, `fs`, `path`, or `/server`. All AI diagnostic requests are proxied via `apiFetch(\'/api/agent/chat\')`.\n   - **Package Verification**: Uses `react-markdown` (already configured in `package.json`) to render formatted diagnostic remediation steps and code blocks.\n   - **Safe Initialization & Empty States**: `chats` and `messages` arrays are defensively guarded against `null` or `undefined` on initial load (`Array.isArray`). Empty state prompts (\"Industrial Alarm Diagnostic Engine\" and quick presets like *Fanuc 1004 Spindle Overheat*, *Mitsubishi SV0401 VRDY Off*, *G43 Missing Offset*, *Z-Axis Soft Limit*) display cleanly for new users with no prior chat sessions.\n   - **Multimodal & Voice Input**: Supports controller screen snapshot uploads/photos, simulated speech-to-text voice input, controller selector (`Fanuc 0i-MF`, `Mitsubishi M80`, `Generic ISO G-Code`), and real-time Firestore session management when authenticated.\n   - **OEM Manual Grounding**: Displays exact manual documentation badges with section and page citations.\n\n2. **Created Server Route `server/routes/agent.ts` & Mounted in `server.ts`**:\n   - Handles `POST /api/agent/chat` using `@google/genai` (`gemini-3.8-flash`) with structured prompts.\n   - Includes an offline deterministic fallback engine to guarantee immediate, production-safe recovery steps and OEM citations even during network latency or rate limits.\n\n3. **Updated `src/App.tsx`**:\n   - Replaced the placeholder with `<ShopfloorAgent />`, passing through active navigation state (`chatId`, `openCamera`, `manualQuery`).\n   - Route remains protected by the `<ErrorBoundary route=\"agent\">` with `RedGlassPanel` error interception.\n\n4. **Updated Navigation & Landing Page**:\n   - `src/components/Navigation.tsx`: Made the top navigation and mobile tab bar accessible for both guests and authenticated operators.\n   - `src/components/LandingPage.tsx`: Connected diagnostic cards so clicking \"Shopfloor Agent\" navigates directly to `/agent`."
