    thinking: "**Analyzing Layout Alignment**\n\nI\'m currently focused on aligning the layout of `ShopfloorAgent.tsx` with the Stitch HTML blueprint. I\'m noting critical differences like the `max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-6` structure, and the discrepancies in width. I also need to use real data for this component.\n\n\n**Refining Structural Mapping**\n\nI\'m now refining the structural mapping. I\'m noting the switch from `grid` to `flex` for layout, and the `aside` for the sidebar, which has a defined width. I\'m focusing on the data mapping, specifically how the data populates the component. I\'m mapping data properties like `chats` to the recent diagnostics list, and messages to the chat stream. I have a clear picture on how the sidebar and main area are structured. I am working on how the buttons, inputs, messages and lists should map to the data. I\'m ensuring proper data binding to `activeChatId`.\n\n\n"
