  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering App Structure**\n\nI\'ve been thinking about replicating the Stitch HTML\'s look more closely. Currently, `App.tsx` has a `main` element with `pt-16` padding. I realize the Stitch HTML also included a footer, and I haven\'t added one to `App.tsx` yet. I\'ll add the Stitch HTML\'s footer to `App.tsx` to keep the user experience consistent.\n\n\n**Adding Footer Content**\n\nI\'m now incorporating the footer from the Stitch HTML into `App.tsx`. I\'ll make sure to use it decoratively, as I recall the user said not to show telemetry. I\'ll need to figure out how to handle the Station ID and Cycle Efficiency elements from the HTML footer.\n\n\n"
