  planner_response {
    response: "The **Shopfloor Agent** page has been fully implemented, matching the provided industrial console design exactly while integrating real data from your Firestore database.\n\n### Key Implementation Details:\n*   **Multimodal Diagnostic Stream**: Replaced the placeholder with a high-fidelity chat interface supporting text queries, camera screen snapshots (simulated pendant capture aesthetics), and voice input.\n*   **Industrial Telemetry Integration**:\n    *   **Sidebar**: Displays real diagnostic session history with relative timestamps (\"2m ago\") and controller-specific badges.\n    *   **Header**: Added a \"Shop Net\" status indicator in the top navigation that syncs with your active machine profile.\n    *   **Footer**: Implemented a global industrial telemetry strip showing the active Node ID (derived from the operator\'s UID) and real-time core status.\n*   **AI Response Panels**: The diagnostic agent now provides structured physical recovery protocols, including:\n    *   **Fault Confidence Metrics**: Real-time probability scoring for detected mechanical events.\n    *   **Mandatory Inspection Checklists**: Step-by-step physical protocols with hazard warnings.\n    *   **OEM Manual Grounding**: Exact citations (document name and page number) for Fanuc and Mitsubishi manuals.\n    *   **Diagnostic Reasoning Chain**: Interactive \"How I got this\" details showing decel inertia and kinematic sampling logic.\n*   **Real Data Mapping**: All session titles, machine profiles, and operator names are pulled directly from your profile and chat history. Telemetry values like RPM and load are only shown when explicitly provided by the diagnostic engine.\n\nThe layout is fully responsive, featuring the exact tokens and spacing requested, with a professional dark industrial theme throughout."
