  user_input {
    user_response: "Before building the Academy, consolidate the design system so every screen uses the same building blocks. Create or reuse these shared components in src/components/ui/ and refactor Dashboard, Calculator, Agent, G-code and Knowledge Base to use them, without changing how those screens look or behave:\nAppShell (top nav, mobile bottom tabs, footer), PageHeader (eyebrow label, title, caption, right-side actions), Card (with optional colored top border: orange, cyan, green, amber, red), GlassPanel, StatChip, Badge (4px radius, semantic color at 12% fill with 40% border, uppercase JetBrains Mono), ButtonPrimary, ButtonSecondary, ButtonDanger, IconButton (48x48), Tabs, SectionHeader, EmptyState, Skeleton, CodeEditor (line numbers, syntax colors, flagged-line highlight), Viewport3D (shared camera, grid, axis triad, lighting), ProgressBar, Drawer.\nAll colors, radii, spacing and fonts come from tailwind.config tokens only; remove any hard-coded hex values from components. List the components created and every file refactored. Do not add new features in this step."
    items {
