GB-ish but matching theme).\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/ui/Viewport3D.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Creating Viewport3D component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Create Viewport3D component\"}"
