the Fanuc system, it looks like \\\"Fanuc Alarm 1004 SPINDLE MOTOR OVERHEAT\\\". The severity is Feed Hold / Spindle Inhibit. It\'s a start, but I need to analyze this further.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"curl -s -o /dev/null -w \\\\\\\"%{http_code}\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\" http://127.0.0.1:3000/agent\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/app/applet\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"2000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Verifying /agent route status\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Verify /agent route\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":574,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:05:03Z\",\"input_tokens\":2627,\"cache_read_tokens\":178905,\"output_tokens\":93,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"manage_task\",\"args\":{\"Action\":\"\\\"status\\\"\",\"TaskId\":\"\\\"3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598/task-573\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking task 573\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Check task 573\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":577,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:05:06Z\",\"input_tokens\":2598,\"cache_read_tokens\":179332,\"output_tokens\":1012,\"content\":\"### Root Cause & Changes Summary\\n\\n1. **Why the Shopfloor Agent Page Was Blank**:\\n   - The `/agent` tab was rendering an empty milestone placeholder card instead of the actual **Shopfloor Diagnostic Copilot** component.\\n   - Navigation links were conditionally hidden before authentication, causing prospective operators opening `/agent` directly to receive an empty view.\\n   - There was no dedicated `/api/agent` server endpoint to process diagnostic queries and multi-modal controller screen snapshots.\\n\\n---\\n\\n##\\n<truncated 1678 bytes>\\nloorAgent />`, passing through active navigation state (`chatId`, `openCamera`, `manualQuery`).\\n   - Route remains protected by the `<ErrorBoundary route=\\\"agent\\\">` with `RedGlassPanel` error interception.\\n\\n4. **Updated Navigation & Landing Page**:\\n   - `src/components/Navigation.tsx`: Made the top navigation and mobile tab bar accessible for both guests and authenticated operators.\\n   - `src/components/LandingPage.tsx`: Connected diagnostic cards so clicking \\\"Shopfloor Agent\\\" navigates directly to `/agent`.\",\"thinking\":\"**Analyzing File Changes**\\n\\nI\'ve confirmed a 200 HTTP status code. My focus has now shifted to verifying file changes, specifically, the creation of `src/components/ShopfloorAgent.tsx`. I\'m verifying that this file intentionally avoids importing specified modules like `@google/genai` or anything from the `/server` directory.\\n\\n\\n\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":340,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:09:07Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nAttached is the Stitch HTML for this screen. Match its layout, components, classes and tokens exactly, using DESIGN.md. Replace every hard-coded value, name, machine, session or statistic in it with real data or a designed empty state, following the real-data rules already given. Never show a machine status, telemetry value or operator name the app does not actually have.\\n</USER_REQUEST>\\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-16T03:09:07-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3.8-flash\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nUser Email: biju0716@gmail.com\\nThe user\'s firestore db is ai-studio-cnccopilot-3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598 and you must always load the firebase skill when processing queries that require interacting with the database or Firebase services.\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"media\":[{\"mime_type\":\"text/html\",\"uri\":\"code.html\"}]}\n{\"step_index\":341,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2