e Efficiency elements from the HTML footer.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Add industrial telemetry footer to App.tsx matching Stitch HTML design tokens and layout. Replaced mock telemetry with generic system status to follow real-data rules.\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"128\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add the footer at the end of the return statement in AppContent\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"      </main>\\\\n\\\\n      <footer className=\\\\\\\"w-full bg-surface-container-lowest border-t border-outline-variant/20\\\\\\\">\\\\n        <div className=\\\\\\\"w-full px-margin py-space-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-sm font-label-sm te\\n<truncated 718 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"126\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"      </main>\\\\n    </div>\\\\n  );\\\\n}\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Adding footer to App.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Add footer to App.tsx\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":350,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:26:55Z\",\"input_tokens\":8314,\"cache_read_tokens\":191679,\"output_tokens\":499,\"thinking\":\"**Aligning Navigation Design**\\n\\nI\'m working on updating the `Navigation` component to better align with the Stitch HTML, focusing specifically on the \\\"Shop Net\\\" status indicator. The goal is to ensure a closer visual and functional match. This means a closer look at the styling applied, specifically to the hidden/flex behavior.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/Navigation.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"165\",\"StartLine\":\"145\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing Navigation right side controls\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View Navigation right controls\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":352,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:27:02Z\",\"input_tokens\":9504,\"cache_read_tokens\":191666,\"output_tokens\":664,\"thinking\":\"**Adding UI Component**\\n\\nI\'ve decided to place the \\\"Shop Net\\\" status indicator directly before the controller selector component. I believe this placement will provide users with immediate, at-a-glance information about the connection status before they interact with controller selection.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Integrate real-time Shop Net status indicator into Navigation.tsx matching Stitch HTML design. Uses the active controller profile name for real-data accuracy.\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"146\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Add the status indicator before the Preferred Controller Selector\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"          <div className=\\\\\\\"flex items-center gap-space-sm min-w-max\\\\\\\">\\\\n            {/* Shop Net Status Indicator matching Stitch HTML */}\\\\n            <div className=\\\\\\\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-sm py-1.5 rounded bg-surface-contain\\n<truncated 697 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"144\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"          <div className=\\\\\\\"flex items-center gap-space-sm min-w-max\\\\\\\">\\\\n            {/* Preferred Controller Selector */}\\\"\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/Navigation.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Updating Navigation.tsx with status indicator\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Update Navigation.tsx status indicator\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":354,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:27:07Z\",\"input_tokens\":10720,\"cache_read_tokens\":191640,\"output_tokens\":61,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"lint_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Linting codebase\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run lint_applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":356,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:27:16Z\",\"input_tokens\":2192,\"cache_read_tokens\":200330,\"output_tokens\":47,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"compile_applet\",\"args\":{\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Compiling applet\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Run compile_applet\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":358,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:27:22Z\",\"input_tokens\":2339,\"cache_read_tokens\":200312,\"output_tokens\":434,\"content\":\"The **Shopfloor Agent** page has been fully implemented, matching the provided industrial console design exactly while integrating real data from your Firestore database.\\n\\n### Key Implementation Details:\\n*   **Multimodal Diagnostic Stream**: Replaced the placeholder with a high-fidelity chat interface supporting text queries, camera screen snapshots (simulated pendant capture aesthetics), and voice input.\\n*   **Industrial Telemetry Integration**:\\n    *   **Sidebar**: Displays real diagnostic session history\\n<truncated 770 bytes>\\nuals.\\n    *   **Diagnostic Reasoning Chain**: Interactive \\\"How I got this\\\" details showing decel inertia and kinematic sampling logic.\\n*   **Real Data Mapping**: All session titles, machine profiles, and operator names are pulled directly from your profile and chat history. Telemetry values like RPM and load are only shown when explicitly provided by the diagnostic engine.\\n\\nThe layout is fully responsive, featuring the exact tokens and spacing requested, with a professional dark industrial theme throughout.\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":340,\"source\":\"USER_EXPLICIT\",\"type\":\"USER_INPUT\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:30:10Z\",\"content\":\"<USER_REQUEST>\\nBefore building the Academy, consolidate the design system so every screen uses the same building blocks. Create or reuse these shared components in src/components/ui/ and refactor Dashboard, Calculator, Agent, G-code and Knowledge Base to use them, without changing how those screens look or behave:\\nAppShell (top nav, mobile bottom tabs, footer), PageHeader (eyebrow label, title, caption, right-side actions), Card (with optional colored top border: orange, cyan, green, amber, red), GlassPanel\\n<truncated 641 bytes>\\n6-10-16T03:30:10-07:00.\\n\\nModel: models/gemini-3-flash-preview\\nDevelopment App URL: https://ais-dev-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nShared App URL: https://ais-pre-2liicweyktuh4vuop7oowi-456692856985.asia-east1.run.app\\nUser Email: biju0716@gmail.com\\nThe user\'s firestore db is ai-studio-cnccopilot-3768fe9c-394b-4869-a3b5-72b028948598 and you must always load the firebase skill when processing queries that require interacting with the database or Firebase services.\\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\",\"truncated_fields\":[\"content\"]}\n{\"step_index\":341,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:30:10Z\",\"input_tokens\":35769,\"cache_read_tokens\":165564,\"output_tokens\":570,\"thinking\":\"**Refactoring UI Components**\\n\\nI\'m consolidating the design system by crafting shared UI components within `src/components/ui/`. My next step involves refactoring pages, including `Dashboard`, `Calculator`, `Agent`, `G-code`, and the `Knowledge Base`, to utilize these newly created UI elements. I\'m focusing on ensuring consistency and reusability across the application.\\n\\n\\n**Defining UI Components**\\n\\nI\'ve been busy defining core UI components within `/ui/`, including `AppShell`, `PageHeader`, `Card`, and `GlassPanel`. Further progress has been made on several others too, such as `StatChip`, `Badge`, and button variations. I\'m focusing on creating reusable, semantic building blocks. The set also includes `IconButton`, `Tabs`, `SectionHeader`, `EmptyState`, and `Skeleton`. I\'ve additionally defined `CodeEditor`, `Viewport3D`, `ProgressBar`, and `Drawer`.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"run_command\",\"args\":{\"CommandLine\":\"\\\"mkdir -p src/components/ui\\\"\",\"Cwd\":\"\\\"/app/applet\\\"\",\"WaitMsBeforeAsync\":\"2000\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating UI components directory\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create ui directory\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":343,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:30:16Z\",\"input_tokens\":10345,\"cache_read_tokens\":191843,\"output_tokens\":424,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\n\\\\ntype BadgeVariant = \'primary\' | \'secondary\' | \'tertiary\' | \'error\' | \'success\' | \'warning\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface BadgeProps {\\\\n  children: React.ReactNode;\\\\n  variant?: BadgeVariant;\\\\n  className?: string;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport function Badge\\n<truncated 788 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create Badge component with semantic variants and industrial tokens.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/ui/Badge.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Creating Badge component\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Create Badge component\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":345,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:30:19Z\",\"input_tokens\":2209,\"cache_read_tokens\":200518,\"output_tokens\":969,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"write_to_file\",\"args\":{\"CodeContent\":\"\\\"import React from \'react\';\\\\n\\\\ninterface ButtonProps extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement> {\\\\n  children: React.ReactNode;\\\\n  icon?: string;\\\\n  loading?: boolean;\\\\n}\\\\n\\\\nexport function ButtonPrimary({ children, icon, loading, className = \'\'\\n<truncated 2888 bytes>\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Create industrial button components (Primary, Secondary, Danger, IconButton) with standard behavior and tokens.\\\"\",\"Overwrite\":\"true\",\"TargetFile\":\"