    session_summary: "{\"step_index\":507,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:38:23Z\",\"input_tokens\":16636,\"cache_read_tokens\":16321,\"output_tokens\":511,\"thinking\":\"**Consolidating UI Components**\\n\\nI\'ve successfully refactored the `Dashboard.tsx` and `CuttingCalculator.tsx` screens to use the shared components within `src/components/ui/`. I\'m starting to see a significant reduction in code duplication. My focus now is shifting to the Agent screen. I\'m excited by the efficiency gained already.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/KnowledgeBase.tsx\\\"\",\"StartLine\":\"828\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Viewing end of KnowledgeBase.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View KnowledgeBase.tsx end\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":509,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:38:28Z\",\"input_tokens\":5415,\"cache_read_tokens\":32717,\"output_tokens\":204,\"thinking\":\"**Refactoring UI Components**\\n\\nI\'m focusing on cleaning up the UI components. The immediate goal is to replace the existing modals with a consistent Drawer implementation, as the prompt suggested. Furthermore, I\'ll be swapping out the manual button and card code with the reusable `Card` and `ButtonPrimary` components. This should enhance consistency and maintainability.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ui/Headers.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking Headers.tsx components\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View Headers.tsx content\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":511,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:38:31Z\",\"input_tokens\":3342,\"cache_read_tokens\":36868,\"output_tokens\":74,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ui/Layout.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking Layout.tsx components\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View Layout.tsx content\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":513,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:38:34Z\",\"input_tokens\":4256,\"cache_read_tokens\":36859,\"output_tokens\":66,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ui/Badge.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking Badge.tsx components\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View Badge.tsx content\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":515,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:38:36Z\",\"input_tokens\":4910,\"cache_read_tokens\":36850,\"output_tokens\":204,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ui/Feedback.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking Feedback.tsx components\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View Feedback.tsx content\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":517,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:38:41Z\",\"input_tokens\":2613,\"cache_read_tokens\":40936,\"output_tokens\":210,\"thinking\":\"**Revising Imports**\\n\\nI\'ve spotted a potential error in the most recent `multi_replace_file_content` action. Specifically, the import statement within `KnowledgeBase.tsx` looks suspect. I need to double-check those imports, as they could be incorrect.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/KnowledgeBase.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"20\",\"StartLine\":\"1\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking imports in KnowledgeBase.tsx\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View KnowledgeBase.tsx imports\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":519,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:38:44Z\",\"input_tokens\":3281,\"cache_read_tokens\":40983,\"output_tokens\":391,\"thinking\":\"**Locating Component Imports**\\n\\nI realized my initial assumption about `Card` and `Badge` being in `Headers.js` was incorrect. `Card` resides in `Layout.js`, and `Badge` lives within `Badge.js`. Then, looking at `Headers.tsx`, I saw the components `PageHeader` and `SectionHeader` defined, so I am going to have to find the source file for those as well.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/KnowledgeBase.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"820\",\"StartLine\":\"500\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking refactored KnowledgeBase.tsx middle part\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View KnowledgeBase.tsx middle content\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":521,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:38:48Z\",\"input_tokens\":9369,\"cache_read_tokens\":41047,\"output_tokens\":169,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/ui/Button.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking Button.tsx components\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View Button.tsx content\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":523,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:38:51Z\",\"input_tokens\":2615,\"cache_read_tokens\":49244,\"output_tokens\":6524,\"thinking\":\"**Mapping Component Usage**\\n\\nI\'ve successfully mapped the components! I\'ve categorized them based on their primary function and location. I can link the specific implementations of `PageHeader`, `SectionHeader`, `StatChip`, `EmptyState`, `Card`, `GlassPanel`, `Badge`, `ButtonPrimary`, `ButtonSecondary`, `ButtonDanger`, and `IconButton` now.\\n\\n\\n\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"multi_replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"Description\":\"\\\"Fix imports and refactor KnowledgeBase modals and results to use shared UI components\\\"\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Correct UI component imports and replace manual modal/card JSX with Drawer, Card, and Badge components in KnowledgeBase.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementChunks\":\"[{\\\"AllowMultiple\\\":false,\\\"EndLine\\\":13,\\\"ReplacementContent\\\":\\\"import { \\\\n  PageHeader, \\\\n  SectionHeader, \\\\n  StatChip, \\\\n  EmptyState \\\\n} from \'./ui/Headers.js\';\\\\nimport { Card } from \'./ui/Layout.js\';\\\\nimport { Badge } from \'./ui/Badge.js\';\\\\nimport { Button\\n<truncated 26455 bytes>\",\"TargetFile\":\"\\\"/src/components/KnowledgeBase.tsx\\\"\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Refactoring KnowledgeBase results and drawers\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"Refactor KnowledgeBase results and drawers\\\"\"}}],\"truncated_fields\":[\"tool_calls\"]}\n{\"step_index\":525,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:39:15Z\",\"input_tokens\":14521,\"cache_read_tokens\":49280,\"output_tokens\":108,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"view_file\",\"args\":{\"AbsolutePath\":\"\\\"/src/components/KnowledgeBase.tsx\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"860\",\"StartLine\":\"800\",\"toolAction\":\"\\\"Checking results stack in KnowledgeBase.tsx again\\\"\",\"toolSummary\":\"\\\"View KnowledgeBase.tsx results stack content\\\"\"}}]}\n{\"step_index\":527,\"source\":\"MODEL\",\"type\":\"PLANNER_RESPONSE\",\"status\":\"DONE\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-16T10:39:19Z\",\"input_tokens\":3545,\"cache_read_tokens\":61587,\"output_tokens\":1388,\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"replace_file_content\",\"args\":{\"AllowMultiple\":\"false\",\"Description\":\"\\\"Refactor KnowledgeBase results stack to use Card and Badge components\\\"\",\"EndLine\":\"856\",\"Instruction\":\"\\\"Replace manual result div with Card and Badge components in KnowledgeBase.tsx\\\"\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"\\\"                {/* Retrieved Chunks Stack */}\\\\n                <div className=\\\\\\\"flex flex-col gap-space-sm\\\\\\\" id=\\\\\\\"retrieval-results-stack\\\\\\\">\\\\n                  {activeChunks.length === 0 ? (\\\\n                    <EmptyState \\\\n                      icon=\\\\\\n<truncated 2783 bytes>\",\"StartLine\":\"806\",\"TargetContent\":\"\\\"   