  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Scene Elements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on improving the realism of the 3D objects within the Academy simulation. Specifically, I\'m examining `src/components/academy/MachineScene.tsx` to understand the machine table\'s current color and material properties as a starting point. The goal is to identify how these can be adjusted to enhance the visual fidelity of the simulation for all of the key components.\n\n\n**Refining Simulation Textures**\n\nI\'ve been making good progress refining the Academy simulation\'s visual elements. My next move is to integrate more plausible hex codes and material characteristics within `MachineScene.tsx`. I\'m starting by updating the machine table to a cast iron look with `#2c2e33`. I\'m going to follow that by adjusting the vise and stock, and then finally applying similar alterations to the end mill and tool holder.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1550282"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Apply realistic industrial colors and materials to Academy 3D objects\",\"EndLine\":112,\"Instruction\":\"Update colors and material properties for table, vise, stock, and tools to match real-world industrial appearances.\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"      {/* Machine Table (Cast Iron) */}\\n      <Box \\n        args={[200, 5, 200]} \\n        position={[40, ACADEMY_GEOMETRY.table.z - 2.5, -25]}\\n      >\\n        <meshStandardMaterial \\n          color={crashObject === \'TABLE\' && isCrashing ? \'#ff0000\' : \'#1a1c1e\'} \\n          metalness={0.4} \\n          roughness={0.7} \\n        />\\n      </Box>\\n\\n      {/* Vise (Industrial Blue) */}\\n      <Box \\n        args={viseSize} \\n        position={visePos}\\n      >\\n        <meshStandardMaterial \\n          color={crashObject === \'VISE\' && isCrashing ? \'#ff0000\' : \'#2b3e50\'} \\n          metalness={0.6} \\n          roughness={0.3} \\n        />\\n      </Box>\\n\\n      {/* Stock (Aluminum 6061) */}\\n      <Box \\n        args={stockSize} \\n        position={stockPos}\\n      >\\n        <meshStandardMaterial \\n          color={crashObject === \'STOCK\' && isCrashing ? \'#ff0000\' : \'#d1d9e0\'} \\n          metalness={0.9} \\n          roughness={0.15} \\n        />\\n      </Box>\\n\\n      {/* Spindle & Tool Group */}\\n      <group ref={toolRef}>\\n        {/* Tool (Dark Carbide End Mill) */}\\n        <Cylinder args={[3, 3, 30, 16]} position={[0, -15, 0]}>\\n          <meshStandardMaterial \\n            color=\\\"#24272b\\\" \\n            metalness={0.8} \\n            roughness={0.2} \\n          />\\n        </Cylinder>\\n        \\n        {/* Tool Holder (Polished Stainless Steel) */}\\n        <Cylinder ref={spindleRef} args={[8, 10, 20, 24]} position={[0, 10, 0]}>\\n          <meshStandardMaterial \\n            color=\\\"#aab2bd\\\" \\n            metalness={1.0} \\n            roughness={0.05} \\n          />\\n        </Cylinder>\\n\\n        {/* Local Spindle Glow */}\\n        {spindleOn && (\\n          <pointLight color=\\\"#22d3ee\\\" intensity={0.8} distance={40} />\\n        )}\\n      </group>\\n\",\"ReplacementContent_explanation\":\"Updated the 3D object properties in MachineScene.tsx for realistic industrial rendering:\\n- Table: Changed to a deep matte grey (#1a1c1e) representing cast iron.\\n- Vise: Updated to \'Kurt Blue\' (#2b3e50) with standard tool-steel roughness.\\n- Stock: Switched to a bright metallic aluminum (#d1d9e0) with high metalness and low roughness.\\n- Tool: Changed end mill to a dark grey/black carbide look (#24272b).\\n- Tool Holder: Updated to a highly reflective polished steel (#aab2bd) with max metalness.\\n- lighting: Subtly adjusted spindle glow intensity for better material response.\",\"StartLine\":64,\"TargetContent\":\"      {/* Machine Table */}\\n      <Box \\n        args={[200, 5, 200]} \\n        position={[40, ACADEMY_GEOMETRY.table.z - 2.5, -25]}\\n      >\\n        <meshStandardMaterial color={crashObject === \'TABLE\' && isCrashing ? \'#ff0000\' : \'#181c21\'} />\\n      </Box>\\n\\n      {/* Vise */}\\n      <Box \\n        args={viseSize} \\n        position={visePos}\\n      >\\n        <meshStandardMaterial \\n          color={crashObject === \'VISE\' && isCrashing ? \'#ff0000\' : \'#223040\'} \\n          metalness={0.8} \\n          roughness={0.2} \\n        />\\n      </Box>\\n\\n      {/* Stock */}\\n      <Box \\n        args={stockSize} \\n        position={stockPos}\\n      >\\n        <meshStandardMaterial \\n          color={crashObject === \'STOCK\' && isCrashing ? \'#ff0000\' : \'#d4dee8\'} \\n          metalness={0.9} \\n          roughness={0.25} \\n        />\\n      </Box>\\n\\n      {/* Spindle & Tool Group */}\\n      <group ref={toolRef}>\\n        {/* Tool (End Mill) */}\\n        <Cylinder args={[3, 3, 30, 16]} position={[0, -15, 0]}>\\n          <meshStandardMaterial color=\\\"#00cbe6\\\" metalness={0.9} roughness={0.1} />\\n        </Cylinder>\\n        \\n        {/* Tool Holder / Spindle Nose */}\\n        <Cylinder ref={spindleRef} args={[8, 10, 20, 24]} position={[0, 10, 0]}>\\n          <meshStandardMaterial color=\\\"#31353b\\\" metalness={0.7} roughness={0.3} />\\n        </Cylinder>\\n\\n        {/* Local Spindle Glow */}\\n        {spindleOn && (\\n          <pointLight color=\\\"#22d3ee\\\" intensity={1} distance={50} />\\n        )}\\n      </group>\\n\",\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/academy/MachineScene.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Applying realistic colors to 3D objects\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update 3D realism 2\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "replace_file_content"
